#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:76
msgid "Witch's Monocle"
msgstr "女巫单片镜"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:76
msgid "Enchanted things glow when they sound, witchlight or not."
msgstr "无论有没有巫灯，附魔物品发出声响时都会发光。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:77
msgid "Witch's Draught"
msgstr "女巫秘药"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:77
msgid "Enchanted things turn up three times as often."
msgstr "附魔物品出现的频率提高到三倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:78
msgid "Aether Jar"
msgstr "以太罐"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:78
msgid ""
"Each enchanted thing you find this run makes everything {0} likelier to be enchanted (up to {1})."
msgstr "本局你每找到一件附魔物品，所有物品附魔的几率就提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:80
msgid "Enchanter's Chalk"
msgstr "附魔粉笔"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:80
msgid ""
"An enchantment spreads: a chest with an enchanted thing in it has a second one."
msgstr "附魔会蔓延：装有附魔物品的宝箱里，必有第二件附魔物品。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:81
msgid "Spellbinder's Ring"
msgstr "缚咒之戒"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:81
msgid "Enchanted things are worth four times as much, not twice."
msgstr "附魔物品的价值变为四倍，而不是两倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:82
msgid "Archmage's Staff"
msgstr "大法师之杖"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:82
msgid "Everything in a chest with an enchanted thing in it is enchanted."
msgstr "宝箱里只要有一件附魔物品，箱中所有物品就都附魔。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:85
msgid "Sealed Bid"
msgstr "暗标"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:85
msgid ""
"Take a chest on its seller's word (no shake, drop or lodestone) and they knock {0} off."
msgstr "全凭卖家一句话买下宝箱（不摇、不摔、不用磁石），对方就减价{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:87
msgid "Lucky Dip"
msgstr "幸运摸彩"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:87
msgid ""
"Everything in a chest you take sight unseen is {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "盲买的宝箱里，每件物品品质提升一级的几率提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:88
msgid "Underwriter's Bond"
msgstr "承保契约"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:88
msgid ""
"A chest bought sight unseen holds less than you paid? The Underwriters pay {0} of it back."
msgstr "盲买的宝箱不值你付的钱？承保人会赔付差额的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:90
msgid "Wholesaler's Tally"
msgstr "批发算筹"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:90
msgid "Every chest you buy today: the next seller asks {0} less (up to {1})."
msgstr "今天你每买下一只宝箱，下一位卖家的要价就降低{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:92
msgid "Gambler's Token"
msgstr "赌徒筹码"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:92
msgid ""
"Twice as many surprises in everything you open: good ones and bad ones."
msgstr "你打开的所有东西，意外都翻倍：有惊喜，也有惊吓。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:93
msgid "Fortune's Blindfold"
msgstr "命运蒙眼布"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:93
msgid ""
"Sight unseen, a chest costs {0} less, and nothing in it comes out worse than promised."
msgstr "盲买的宝箱便宜{0}，而且箱里的东西都不会低于应有的品质。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:97
msgid "Merchant's Signet"
msgstr "商人印戒"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:97
msgid ""
"Hagglers hear you out (an offer too low gets a second try), and come down {0} further."
msgstr "爱讨价还价的卖家会耐心听你出价（出价太低还能再试一次），而且会再多让价{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:99
msgid "Silver Tongue"
msgstr "银舌"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:99
msgid ""
"Hagglers come down a fifth further, and those who wait for an offer take a fifth less."
msgstr "爱讨价还价的卖家多让价五分之一，请你出价的卖家也会少收五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:100
msgid "Haggler's Knot"
msgstr "议价绳结"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:100
msgid ""
"Each chest you talk down this run makes every seller ask {0} less (up to {1})."
msgstr "本局你每砍价成功一只宝箱，所有卖家的要价就降低{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:102
msgid "Waiting Game"
msgstr "欲擒故纵"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:102
msgid ""
"Every chest you pass makes the next seller ask {0} less (up to {1}). Buying starts it again."
msgstr "你每放弃一只宝箱，下一位卖家的要价就降低{0}（最多{1}）。一旦买下宝箱，就从头算起。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:104
msgid "Closing Bell"
msgstr "打烊钟"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:104
msgid "The last customer of the day asks {0} less."
msgstr "当天最后一位顾客的要价降低{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:105
msgid "Haggler's Purse"
msgstr "议价钱袋"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:105
msgid ""
"Everyone haggles with you, and you keep {0} of whatever you talk them down by."
msgstr "人人都跟你讨价还价；你每砍下一笔价，还能额外得到砍掉金额的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:107
msgid "Golden Tongue"
msgstr "金舌"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:107
msgid ""
"Everyone haggles and nobody walks out: go low, and they take {0} under their least."
msgstr "人人都讨价还价，而且没人会拂袖而去：大胆压价，他们能接受比底价再低{0}的价格。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:111
msgid "Ear Trumpet"
msgstr "助听筒"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:111
msgid "Nothing drowns out or muffles a sound for you: no clank, and no straw."
msgstr "对你来说，没有声音会被盖过或闷住：哐啷声不行，稻草也不行。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:112
msgid "Pocket Watch"
msgstr "怀表"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:112
msgid ""
"Impatient sellers give you twice as long, and a rotten chest stands twice the shaking."
msgstr "没耐心的卖家会给你双倍的时间，朽坏的宝箱也经得起两倍的摇晃。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:113
msgid "Counting Beads"
msgstr "计数珠"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:113
msgid ""
"Every chest comes with a tally of how many things are in it, false bottom and all."
msgstr "每只宝箱都附带一份清单，写明里面有几件东西，夹层里的也算在内。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:114
msgid "Appraiser's Seal"
msgstr "估价师印章"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:114
msgid "A perfect read pays you a valuer's fee: {0} of what the chest held."
msgstr "完美判断能为你赚得一笔鉴定费：宝箱所值的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:115
msgid "Valuer's Register"
msgstr "估值登记簿"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:115
msgid ""
"A perfect read pays {0} of what the chest held for each one so far this run (up to {1})."
msgstr "完美判断时，本局至今每有一次完美判断，就赚得宝箱所值的{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:117
msgid "Cursed Crescent"
msgstr "诅咒新月"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:117
msgid ""
"Everything comes out exactly as its chest promised. Sellers sense the curse and ask {0} less."
msgstr "所有物品都会恰好是宝箱应有的品质。卖家们察觉到诅咒，要价降低{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:119
msgid "Tuning Fork"
msgstr "音叉"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:119
msgid ""
"Each perfect read in a row: the next chest's things sell for {0} more (up to {1})."
msgstr "每连续做出一次完美判断：下一只宝箱里的东西售价提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:121
msgid "Ledger of Certainty"
msgstr "确凿账簿"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:121
msgid ""
"A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for {0} more. A wrong slip: {1} less."
msgstr "完美判断：箱里所有东西售价提高{0}。估价单出错：售价降低{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid "Truthglass"
msgstr "照真镜"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid "A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for half as much again."
msgstr "完美判断：箱里所有东西售价提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:126
msgid "Padded Crate"
msgstr "软垫木箱"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:126
msgid "Glass never breaks when you drop a chest."
msgstr "摔箱时，玻璃永远不会碎。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid "Smuggler's Hook"
msgstr "走私铁钩"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid "Smugglers come your way: false bottoms turn up twice as often."
msgstr "走私贩找上门来：夹层出现的频率翻倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:128
msgid "Hollow Rod"
msgstr "空心杖"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:128
msgid ""
"What's under a false bottom comes out a step better: people hid their best."
msgstr "夹层里的东西品质提升一级：人们总把最好的藏起来。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid "Smuggler's Log"
msgstr "走私日志"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid ""
"Smugglers trust a buyer who keeps quiet: each false bottom you open makes them {0} likelier (up to {1})."
msgstr "走私贩信得过守口如瓶的买家：你每打开一个夹层，夹层出现的几率就提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid "Black Market Pass"
msgstr "黑市通行证"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid ""
"Thornwick's black market pays double for anything from under a false bottom."
msgstr "荆棘镇的黑市愿以双倍价格收购任何从夹层里取出的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:132
msgid "Smugglers' Compass"
msgstr "走私罗盘"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:132
msgid "Every chest has a false bottom."
msgstr "每只宝箱都有夹层。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:135
msgid "Warden's Lantern"
msgstr "巡守提灯"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:135
msgid ""
"Every sign a seller leaves (a dream, a tag, a riddle, a card...) points at a warded thing."
msgstr "卖家留下的每个征兆（梦、标签、谜语、纸牌……）都指向一件被结界封住的物品。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:137
msgid "Sleeper's Pillow"
msgstr "眠者之枕"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:137
msgid ""
"Sellers dream true for you: {0} of them have warded something, and tell you their dream."
msgstr "卖家们会为你做真梦：其中{0}的人用结界封住了东西，还会把梦告诉你。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:139
msgid "Wardbreaker's Tally"
msgstr "破界算筹"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:139
msgid ""
"Each warded thing you name this run makes warded things sell for {0} more."
msgstr "本局你每说中一件被结界封住的物品，结界物品的售价就提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:140
msgid "Ward-Key"
msgstr "结界之钥"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:140
msgid "A warded thing you name comes out a step better."
msgstr "你说中的结界物品，品质提升一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:141
msgid "The Aldric Seal"
msgstr "奥德里克之印"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:141
msgid ""
"Every chest has a warded thing, and its seller tells you a sign for it."
msgstr "每只宝箱里都有一件被结界封住的物品，卖家还会告诉你一个指向它的征兆。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid "Lucky Shell"
msgstr "幸运贝壳"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid ""
"A dry spell ends twice as soon: luck starts to turn after {0} plain finds, not {1}."
msgstr "霉运期缩短一半：连续开出{0}件平平无奇的东西后，运气就会好转，而不必等到{1}件。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:146
msgid "Lucky Coin"
msgstr "幸运币"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:146
msgid ""
"The first chest you buy each day: everything in it gets two tries at its quality."
msgstr "每天买下的第一只宝箱：箱里每件物品的品质都能试两次，取好的那次。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:147
msgid "Rabbit's Foot"
msgstr "幸运兔脚"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:147
msgid ""
"Everything you open is {0} likelier to come out a step better than its chest."
msgstr "你打开的所有物品，品质比宝箱高一级的几率提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:148
msgid "Wishbone"
msgstr "许愿骨"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:148
msgid ""
"Something that comes out better than its chest sells for half as much again."
msgstr "品质优于宝箱的物品，售价提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:149
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "马蹄铁"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:149
msgid ""
"Luck runs in streaks: each chest with a surprise makes the next {0} luckier (up to {1})."
msgstr "好运接二连三：每只开出惊喜的宝箱，都让下一只的运气提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:151
msgid "Four-Leaf Clover"
msgstr "四叶草"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:151
msgid ""
"The first chest you buy each week: everything in it comes out a step better."
msgstr "每周买下的第一只宝箱：箱里每件物品的品质都提升一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:152
msgid "Shooting Star"
msgstr "流星"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:152
msgid ""
"Once a day, the first thing to come out better than its chest climbs a step further."
msgstr "每天一次：第一件品质优于宝箱的物品，品质再多升一级。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:153
msgid "Fate's Spindle"
msgstr "命运纺锤"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:153
msgid ""
"Each surprise this run makes everything {0} likelier to come out a step better (up to {1})."
msgstr "本局每出现一次惊喜，所有物品品质提升一级的几率就提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:157
msgid "Shop Lantern"
msgstr "店铺灯笼"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:157
msgid "Open late: one more customer every day."
msgstr "营业到深夜：每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:158
msgid "Queue Ticket"
msgstr "排队号牌"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:158
msgid ""
"The first chest you pass each day comes back at the end of the day, asking {0} less."
msgstr "每天你放弃的第一只宝箱，会在当天结束时回来，要价降低{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:160
msgid "Barker's Horn"
msgstr "揽客号角"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:160
msgid "Two more customers every day, but word's out: everyone asks {0} more."
msgstr "每天多两位顾客，但名声传开了：人人要价都高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:161
msgid "Guest Book"
msgstr "贵宾簿"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:161
msgid ""
"The day's first customer is the better sort: their chest is a colour finer."
msgstr "每天的第一位顾客是更体面的客人：他的宝箱颜色高一档。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:164
msgid "Collector's Catalogue"
msgstr "藏家图录"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:164
msgid "Every new kind of find this run pays {0}g (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr "本局每有一样新发现，就能得到{0}金（店铺越气派，金额越高）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:165
msgid "Bell Jar"
msgstr "玻璃钟罩"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:165 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:47 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:56
#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:59 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:66 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:68
msgid "Room to display one more thing."
msgstr "可多陈列一件物品。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:166
msgid "Visitors' Book"
msgstr "访客簿"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:166
msgid ""
"Every night, visitors leave {0}g per exhibition point (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr "每晚，访客按每一展览分留下{0}金（店铺越气派，金额越高）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:168
msgid "Velvet Rope"
msgstr "天鹅绒围绳"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:168
msgid "Your exhibition counts double."
msgstr "你的展览值翻倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:169
msgid "Gallery Lamps"
msgstr "展厅灯"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:169
msgid "Everything sells for {0} more per exhibition point (up to {1})."
msgstr "每有一展览分，所有东西售价就提高{0}（最多{1}）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:173
msgid "Smith's Glove"
msgstr "铁匠手套"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:173
msgid ""
"You mend weapons: never worse than their chest promised, and {0} likelier to come out better."
msgstr "你会修补兵器：兵器绝不会低于宝箱应有的品质，品质提升的几率还会提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:175
msgid "Hatter's Cap"
msgstr "帽匠软帽"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:175
msgid ""
"You mend cloaks: never worse than their chest promised, and {0} likelier to come out better."
msgstr "你会修补斗篷：斗篷绝不会低于宝箱应有的品质，品质提升的几率还会提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:177
msgid "Whetstone"
msgstr "磨刀石"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:177
msgid "Weapons sell for three-quarters more."
msgstr "兵器售价提高四分之三。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:178
msgid "Tailor's Dummy"
msgstr "裁缝假人"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:178
msgid ""
"Cloaks sell for half as much again, and count {0} times over on display."
msgstr "斗篷售价提高一半，陈列时展览分按{0}倍计算。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:179
msgid "Moneychanger's Scales"
msgstr "钱商天平"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:179
msgid "Coin sells for a fifth more for every purse of it in the chest."
msgstr "宝箱里每有一袋钱币，箱里的钱币售价就提高五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:180
msgid "Alchemist's Still"
msgstr "炼金蒸馏器"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:180
msgid ""
"Potions sell for half as much again, and broken glass still sells for half."
msgstr "药水售价提高一半，破碎的药水也能卖出一半的价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:181
msgid "Scribe's Desk"
msgstr "抄写员书桌"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:181
msgid ""
"Spells sell for half as much again, and sand sells as ink, for a third of a spell."
msgstr "法术售价提高一半，沙子也能当吸墨沙卖，价钱是一卷法术的三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:182
msgid "Gem Cutter's Wheel"
msgstr "宝石切割轮"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:182
msgid "Gems are {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "宝石品质提升一级的几率提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:185
msgid "Locksmith's Oil"
msgstr "锁匠油"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:185
msgid "Every lock has one pin fewer."
msgstr "每把锁少一个锁销。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:186
msgid "Burglar's Knife"
msgstr "窃贼小刀"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:186
msgid "Forcing a lock breaks nothing and scratches nothing."
msgstr "强行撬锁既不会打碎东西，也不会刮花东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:187
msgid "Kid Gloves"
msgstr "羔皮手套"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:187
msgid "Nobody minds a hard shake, a drop or the lodestone on their chest."
msgstr "对他们的宝箱猛摇、摔一下或是用磁石，谁都不介意。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:190
msgid "Jeweller's Loupe"
msgstr "珠宝放大镜"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:190
msgid ""
"Paste gems and demon gold sell as costume pieces: a quarter of the real thing."
msgstr "仿造宝石和魔金可以当作戏服饰品出售：卖得真货四分之一的价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:191
msgid "Fence's Mark"
msgstr "销赃暗记"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:191
msgid ""
"Crooks come twice as often, and the Maw's buyers pay for any fake what the real thing fetches."
msgstr "骗子上门的次数翻倍，而巨口的买家收购任何假货，都按真货的价钱付钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:195
msgid "Rainy-Day Purse"
msgstr "应急钱袋"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:195
msgid "Bram's stash has one more dip in it."
msgstr "布拉姆的私房钱可以多动用一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:196
msgid "Pawn Ticket"
msgstr "当票"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:196
msgid ""
"On a short night, what you pawn fetches four-fifths of its price, not three-fifths."
msgstr "缴不齐贡金的夜里，你典当的东西能换得售价的五分之四，而不是五分之三。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:197
msgid "Guildsman's Marker"
msgstr "公会信物"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:197
msgid "Bram's word is good twice a run, not once."
msgstr "布拉姆的担保每局可用两次，而不是一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:198
msgid "Savings Jar"
msgstr "储蓄罐"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:198
msgid ""
"Every night: {0} of your gold as interest (up to {1}g at the stall, more in a grander shop)."
msgstr "每晚：获得你所持金币的{0}作为利息（摆摊时最多{1}金，店铺越气派上限越高）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:200
msgid "Miser's Lockbox"
msgstr "守财奴钱匣"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:200
msgid "Every Guild night, once you've paid: {0} of what's left in your purse."
msgstr "每个公会之夜，缴清贡金后：获得钱袋里余额的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:202
msgid "Guild Promissory Note"
msgstr "公会本票"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:202
msgid ""
"The Guild's own paper: once a run, on a Guild night you can't cover, it pays what's short (not the last week)."
msgstr "公会自家的票据：每局一次，在你缴不齐贡金的公会之夜，它会补足差额（最后一周除外）。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:205
msgid "Letter of Introduction"
msgstr "介绍信"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:205
msgid "Regulars take what you deliver a quality lower than they asked for."
msgstr "你交付的东西即使比常客要求的低一级品质，他们也照收不误。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:206
msgid "Patron's Ribbon"
msgstr "委托人缎带"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:206
msgid "Commissions pay half as much again."
msgstr "委托报酬提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:207
msgid "Errand Book"
msgstr "差事簿"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:207
msgid "The regulars post {0} more commissions every week."
msgstr "常客每周多发布{0}个委托。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:209
msgid "Songcatcher's Net"
msgstr "捕歌网"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:209
msgid "Heartsongs are three times as likely to be in a chest."
msgstr "宝箱里出现心歌的几率提高到三倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:255
msgid "surprises (things better than their chest)"
msgstr "惊喜（品质优于宝箱的物品）"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:256
