#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:154
msgid "{price}, now."
msgstr "现在要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:186 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:463
msgid "Done."
msgstr "成交。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:186
msgid "Pleasure."
msgstr "合作愉快。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:187
msgid "{price}, and that's my last word."
msgstr "{price}，不能再少了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:188
msgid "More than that, surely."
msgstr "总得比这多吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:189
msgid "Forget it, then."
msgstr "那就算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:192 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:195
msgid "Careful! That'll cost you extra."
msgstr "小心！这得加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:275
msgid "listens ({0})"
msgstr "{0}摇听声"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:276
msgid "listens gently, then hard"
msgstr "先轻摇再猛摇听声"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:277
msgid "counts the rattles"
msgstr "数响声"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:278
msgid "goes by weight"
msgstr "看重量"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:279
msgid "goes by the chest's colour"
msgstr "看宝箱颜色"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:280
msgid "dreams up a price"
msgstr "梦里定价"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:281
msgid "knows only weapons"
msgstr "只懂兵器"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:282
msgid "knows only her own gems"
msgstr "只认得自己的宝石"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:283
msgid "has no idea"
msgstr "一无所知"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:284
msgid "knows exactly"
msgstr "一清二楚"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:294
msgid "{0} priced what's heard at a {1} shake."
msgstr "{0}按{1}摇时听到的东西定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:295
msgid "{0} priced what's heard gently and hard."
msgstr "{0}按轻摇和猛摇时听到的东西定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:296
msgid "{0} priced each rattle at a {1} shake alike."
msgstr "{0}{1}摇后数响声，每声同价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:297
msgid "{0} priced it by the pound."
msgstr "{0}按磅数定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:298
msgid "{0} priced it by the chest's colour."
msgstr "{0}按宝箱颜色定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:299
msgid "{0}'s price came from a dream."
msgstr "{0}的价格来自一场梦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:300
msgid ""
"{0} priced a hard shake: weapons in full, gems as diamonds, the rest at half."
msgstr "{0}按猛摇定价：兵器算全价，宝石全当钻石，其余算半价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:301
msgid "{0} priced only her own gems."
msgstr "{0}只给她自己的宝石定了价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:302
msgid "{0} has no idea what's inside."
msgstr "{0}完全不知道里面有什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:303
msgid "{0} priced everything in it as real."
msgstr "{0}把里面的东西全当真货定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:326
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "随你便。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:326 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:553
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr "是你吃亏。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:326
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr "那就下次吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:329
msgid "Careful with that!"
msgstr "小心点！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:329
msgid "Mind the floor!"
msgstr "当心地板！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:329
msgid "Easy!"
msgstr "轻点！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:343
msgid "Pip Hollow"
msgstr "皮普·霍洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:343
msgid "Pip"
msgstr "皮普"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:345
msgid ""
"A coin for his mother, and to be left alone. He has the Key-mark, and doesn't know what it means."
msgstr "给妈妈挣几个钱，也希望没人来烦他。他有钥纹，却不知道那意味着什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:347
msgid ""
"Fished it out of the millpond! Mum says never shake things, so I didn't. What'll you give me?"
msgstr "从磨坊池塘里捞上来的！妈妈说千万别乱摇东西，所以我没摇。你给我多少？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:348
msgid ""
"It was stuck in the mill wheel. Mum does the mill's washing, and it came up in a sheet! How much will you give me?"
msgstr "它卡在磨坊的水车上。妈妈给磨坊洗衣服，它是裹在床单里冒出来的！你给我多少钱？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:349
msgid ""
"It was under Gran's bed. She says I can sell it if it buys Mum's soap. What's it worth?"
msgstr "它在奶奶床底下。奶奶说，要是能换来妈妈的肥皂，我就可以卖掉它。它值多少钱？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:350
msgid ""
"Found it in the hayloft, behind the cat. The cat didn't want it. How much?"
msgstr "在干草棚里找到的，就在猫后头。猫不要它。多少钱？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:351
msgid ""
"A washerwoman's boy of nine who fishes chests out of the millpond and never shakes them: he has no idea what's in one, and asks you to name a price. A few coins will do, but a millpond chest is sometimes empty."
msgstr ""
"洗衣妇家九岁的儿子，常从磨坊池塘里捞箱子，却从来不摇：他完全不知道里面有什么，会请你出价。给几枚金币就够了，不过池塘里捞上来的箱子有时是空的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:353
msgid "Yes! Mum can have new soap!"
msgstr "太好了！妈妈能买新肥皂了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:353
msgid "Really? Thanks, mister!"
msgstr "真的吗？谢谢老板！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:354
msgid "Is that all? Um... a bit more?"
msgstr "就这么点？嗯……再多一点？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:354
msgid "Mum says don't take the first offer."
msgstr "妈妈说，别接受第一个出价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:355
msgid "Aww. I'll ask at the Crossed Keys."
msgstr "唉。那我去交钥酒馆问问。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:355
msgid "Never mind. Gran will have it back."
msgstr "算了。奶奶会收回去的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:356
msgid "Aww. Okay."
msgstr "唉。好吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:356
msgid "I'll throw it back, then."
msgstr "那我把它扔回去好了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:357
msgid "Hey! That's MY chest!"
msgstr "喂！那可是我的箱子！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:357
msgid "Whoa! Do it again!"
msgstr "哇！再来一次！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:358
msgid "You dropped it! Now it costs more!"
msgstr "你把它摔了！现在要加钱！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:362
msgid "Ada Kettle"
msgstr "艾达·凯特尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:362
msgid "Ada"
msgstr "艾达"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:364
msgid ""
"To buy her son Jory out of the Guild's debt-house, where he's working off his father's tithe."
msgstr "把儿子乔里从公会的债务监狱赎出来，他正在那儿做苦工，抵他父亲欠的贡金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:365 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:475 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:528
msgid "Right-handed."
msgstr "惯用右手。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:365
msgid "Hands red from the washtub, no ink."
msgstr "双手被洗衣盆泡得通红，没有墨迹。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:365
msgid "Wooden clogs."
msgstr "穿木鞋。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:367
msgid ""
"My Rafe's soldiering chest. Only a gentle shake: I couldn't bear to hear his things rattle. {price}, for Jory's debt?"
msgstr "这是我家雷夫当兵时的箱子。我只轻轻摇了摇：听着他的东西在里头乱响，我受不了。{price}，给乔里还债，行吗？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:368
msgid ""
"Rafe carried this through two wars. A gentle shake was all I could bear. {price} would help my Jory."
msgstr "雷夫带着它打过两场仗。我只忍心轻轻摇一下。{price}就能帮上我家乔里。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:369
msgid ""
"From the attic, dear. Just a gentle shake: my wrists aren't what they were. {price}? Every coin's for Jory."
msgstr "从阁楼上拿来的，孩子。只轻轻摇了摇：我这手腕不比从前了。{price}？每一枚都是给乔里的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:370
msgid ""
"A soldier's widow selling her husband's things to free her son from the Guild's debt-house. She only ever shakes a chest gently, so what's heavy (a weapon) or soft (a cloak) never makes a sound for her, and she doesn't price it. A soldier's kitbag usually holds both."
msgstr ""
"一位士兵的遗孀，变卖亡夫的遗物，想把儿子从公会的债务监狱赎出来。她摇箱子向来只轻摇，所以沉的东西（兵器）和软的东西（斗篷）在她手里从不出声，她也就不算钱。士兵的行囊里通常两样都有。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:373
msgid "Thank you, dear. That's a week off Jory's debt."
msgstr "谢谢你，孩子。乔里的债又能少一周了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:373
msgid "Bless you. Rafe would have liked you."
msgstr "老天保佑你。雷夫会喜欢你的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:374
msgid "I'm sorry, dear, I can't stand here all day."
msgstr "抱歉，孩子，我不能在这儿站一整天。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:374
msgid "I'll come back when you're less busy."
msgstr "等你不忙了我再来。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:375
msgid "That's all right, dear. I'll keep it a while longer."
msgstr "没关系，孩子。我再留它一阵子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:375
msgid "Never mind. It was good of you to look."
msgstr "没关系。谢谢你肯看一看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:376
msgid "Oh! Gently, dear, please."
msgstr "哎呀！轻点，孩子，求你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:376
msgid "Oh my. Those were Rafe's things."
msgstr "天哪。那可是雷夫的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:377
msgid "Those were Rafe's things! I'm sorry, but I'll want more now."
msgstr "那可是雷夫的东西！对不住，现在我得多要点钱了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:381
msgid "Garrick Thorne"
msgstr "加里克·索恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:381
msgid "Garrick"
msgstr "加里克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:383
msgid ""
"His rent paid before the Guild's bailiffs come for Brindle Field, which his family's ploughed for two hundred years."
msgstr "赶在公会的法警来收布林德尔田之前交上租子，那块地他家已经耕了两百年。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:384
msgid ""
"Ploughed it up on Brindle Field, where the last battle was. Shook it hard, like the hay. {price}, and it's the rent!"
msgstr "在布林德尔田里犁出来的，最后那场大仗就是在那儿打的。我像抖干草一样使劲摇过了。{price}，就够交租了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:385
msgid ""
"Every spring that field coughs up another one. Shook it like a sack of turnips. {price}: the bailiffs won't wait."
msgstr "那块地每年开春都要再吐出一只来。我像摇一麻袋萝卜那样摇过了。{price}：法警可不等人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:386
msgid ""
"A farmer who ploughs chests up out of Brindle Field, the old battlefield, and shakes them hard, so a clanking weapon drowns out any coin for him. He haggles, and starts at about twice what he'll take."
msgstr "一个农夫，常从布林德尔田那片古战场里犁出箱子。他总是猛摇，所以在他听来，兵器的哐啷声会盖过所有钱币声。他爱讨价还价，开价大约是他底价的两倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:388
msgid "Deal! That's the rent, near enough."
msgstr "成交！租子差不多够了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:388
msgid "Done! The bailiffs can whistle."
msgstr "成交！让那帮法警喝西北风去吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:389
msgid "Hmm. {price}, and that's my last word."
msgstr "嗯。{price}，不能再少了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:389
msgid "The rent won't pay itself. {price}."
msgstr "租子可不会自己交上去。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:390
msgid "Daylight robbery! Forget it."
msgstr "这简直是明抢！算了吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:390
msgid "I've cows to milk. Good day."
msgstr "我还得回去挤奶。告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:391
msgid "Your loss. Field's full of them."
msgstr "是你吃亏。地里多的是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:391
msgid "Suit yourself. I'll be back after the next ploughing."
msgstr "随你。等下回犁完地我再来。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:392
msgid "Steady on! It's not a sack of spuds."
msgstr "悠着点！这又不是一麻袋萝卜。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:392
msgid "Ha! Mind your toes."
msgstr "哈！当心你的脚趾头。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:393
msgid "Easy with my chest! That'll cost you extra."
msgstr "轻点对待我的箱子！这得加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:397
msgid "Bettany Crane"
msgstr "贝塔妮·克雷恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:397
msgid "Bettany"
msgstr "贝塔妮"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:399
msgid ""
"To keep the Crossed Keys, and her secrets. Everyone's news passes through her taproom first."
msgstr "守住交钥酒馆，也守住她的秘密。人人的消息都先从她的酒馆经过。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:400
msgid "Pulls pints left-handed."
msgstr "用左手打酒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:400
msgid "Ink on her fingers from the tally."
msgstr "手指上沾着记账的墨迹。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:400
msgid "Wears house slippers; never rides."
msgstr "穿家居拖鞋；从不骑马。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:401
msgid ""
"Some adventurer left this for his tab at the Crossed Keys. Firm shake, and I counted the rattles. So much a rattle: {price}."
msgstr "有个冒险家把它留在交钥酒馆抵酒账。我稳摇了一下，数了数响声。一响一个价：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:402
msgid ""
"Three nights' ale and a broken bench, paid in chest. I charge by the rattle, love: {price}. And I've news, if you're buying."
msgstr "三晚的麦酒钱，外加一条坐坏的长凳，拿箱子抵的账。我按响声收钱，亲爱的：{price}。我这儿还有消息，要买尽管开口。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:403
msgid ""
"Keeps the Crossed Keys at the crossroads, takes chests for unpaid tabs, and hears everything first. She gives one a firm shake, counts the rattles, and charges the same for each, whatever's rattling: a goblin cleaver costs what a purse of coin does."
msgstr ""
"在十字路口开交钥酒馆，收箱子抵赊欠的酒账，什么消息都最先听到。她把箱子稳摇一下，数数有几声响，每声收一样的钱，不管响的是什么：一把哥布林砍刀和一袋钱币一个价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:405
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "跟你做生意真痛快！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:405
msgid "Done, love. Come by for a pint, and the news."
msgstr "成交，亲爱的。有空来喝一杯，顺便听听消息。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:406
msgid "I've a taproom to run, love. Another time."
msgstr "我还得照看酒馆呢，亲爱的。改天吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:407
msgid "Suit yourself, love. Someone'll have it."
msgstr "随你，亲爱的。总有人会要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:407
msgid "Fair enough. I'll stick it behind the bar."
msgstr "行吧。我把它塞到吧台后面去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:408
msgid "Oi! I'll want that back in one piece."
msgstr "喂！还我的时候可得完好无损。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:408
msgid "Mind my floor, love."
msgstr "当心我的地板，亲爱的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:409
msgid "Oi! You break it, you pay for it, love. Half again."
msgstr "喂！弄坏了就得赔，亲爱的。价钱涨一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:413
msgid "Tobin Reed"
msgstr "托宾·里德"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:413
msgid "Tobin"
msgstr "托宾"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:415
msgid ""
"One big find, to clear the Guild's claim on his father's tithe and never go down the Barrow again."
msgstr "挖到一件大宝贝，还清公会向他父亲追讨的贡金，从此再也不下古冢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:416
msgid ""
"Dragged it up from the Barrow's second vault. The damp's got into the wood: go easy, it won't stand much. {price}."
msgstr "从古冢第二层墓室拖上来的。木头已经受潮了：轻点，它经不起折腾。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:417
msgid ""
"From the Barrow. Lost my torch and my nerve down there, but I kept the chest. It's half rotten. {price}, for the Guild."
msgstr "古冢里来的。我在下面丢了火把，也丢了胆子，可箱子没丢。它已经朽了一半。{price}，是要交给公会的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:418
msgid ""
"I ran from a barrow-wight for this, so it's yours for {price}. Careful: it's falling apart."
msgstr "为了它，我被古冢尸妖追着跑，所以只要{price}，它就归你。小心：它快散架了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:419
msgid ""
"A young delver who goes down the Barrow to pay what the Guild says his father owed. Prices a chest by its colour and never shakes it: Barrow chests are so rotten they stand about two seconds of shaking before they start to come apart. Grave goods: coin, weapons, gems."
msgstr ""
"一个年轻的探墓人，下古冢挖宝，好还上公会说他父亲欠下的债。他按箱子的颜色定价，从来不摇：古冢的箱子朽得厉害，摇上大约两秒就会开始散架。陪葬品：钱币、兵器、宝石。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:422
msgid "That's another week the Guild leaves me be."
msgstr "公会又能放过我一周了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:422
msgid "Right. Back to the Barrow."
msgstr "好了。回古冢去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:423
msgid "Sorry, I've a barrow to get back to."
msgstr "抱歉，我得回古冢了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:424
msgid "Fair enough. Someone at the Crossed Keys will want it."
msgstr "也行。交钥酒馆总会有人要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:424
msgid "Oh well. More where that came from."
msgstr "算了。那儿还多的是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:425
msgid "Careful, it's rotten!"
msgstr "小心，它都朽了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:425
msgid "Whoa! It'll fall apart!"
msgstr "哇！它会散架的！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:426
msgid "It's held together with damp and hope! You'll pay more for that."
msgstr "它全靠潮气和指望撑着呢！你得为这个多付钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:432 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:432
msgid "Nettle"
msgstr "荨麻"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:434
msgid ""
"Her clan cleared of every theft in Thornwick, and a burrow with a door: a goblin's worth is the chests she keeps."
msgstr "为她的部族洗清荆棘镇每一桩偷窃的嫌疑，再换个带门的地洞：哥布林的身价，就看她守着多少箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:435
msgid ""
"From our burrow. Not stolen! Goblins get the blame for everything. Gentle shake, only gentle. {price}. Looking is free. Looking more, not free!"
msgstr "我们地洞里来的。不是偷的！什么坏事都赖哥布林。轻摇，只能轻摇。{price}。看看，免费。多看，不免费！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:436
msgid ""
"Nettle's clan dug it up fair and square. Gentle shake only. {price}. You want to shake more? You pay more!"
msgstr "荨麻的部族挖出来的，光明正大。只许轻摇。{price}。你想多摇？你多付钱！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:437
msgid ""
"Burrow chest. Smells of goblin. Is fine. {price}, and more every time you shake it different."
msgstr "地洞箱子。有哥布林味。没事。{price}，你每换一种摇法，就多加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:438
msgid "Ooh, you like! Price go up: {price}."
msgstr "哦哦，你喜欢！价钱涨：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:438
msgid "More shaking, more gold! {price}."
msgstr "多摇，多给金子！{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:438
msgid "Hehe. {price} now."
msgstr "嘿嘿。现在{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:439
msgid ""
"A goblin of the hills, trading chests out of her clan's burrow (fairly: she'll tell you so). She only shakes gently, so she never prices what a gentle shake can't stir, and goblins charge for everything, looking included: each strength you try after your first puts her price up a tenth."
msgstr ""
"山里的哥布林，拿她部族地洞里的箱子做买卖（来路正当：她会这么告诉你）。她只轻摇，所以轻摇摇不响的东西她从不算钱；而哥布林什么都收钱，连看都要钱：你试过第一种力度后，每多试一种，她就涨价一成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:442
msgid "Shiny! Shiny!"
msgstr "亮晶晶！亮晶晶！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:442
msgid "Hehehe. Nettle's burrow gets a door!"
msgstr "嘿嘿嘿。荨麻的地洞要装门啦！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:443
msgid "Pah! Nettle has other customers."
msgstr "呸！荨麻还有别的客人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:444
msgid "Pah! Nettle sell it to someone with eyes."
msgstr "呸！荨麻卖给长眼睛的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:444
msgid "Your loss. Nettle's gain. Nettle always gains."
msgstr "你亏。荨麻赚。荨麻总是赚。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:445
msgid "Eek! Nettle's chest!"
msgstr "咿！荨麻的箱子！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:445
msgid "Hehe, again! Again!"
msgstr "嘿嘿，再来！再来！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:446
msgid "You drop Nettle's chest? Price go up!"
msgstr "你摔荨麻的箱子？价钱涨！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:450
msgid "Rook Varga"
msgstr "鲁克·瓦尔加"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:450
msgid "Rook"
msgstr "鲁克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:453
msgid "The Magpie's bounty, the biggest the Wardens have ever posted."
msgstr "拿下喜鹊的悬赏，那是巡守开出过的最大一笔赏金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:454
msgid "Draws her bow left-handed."
msgstr "用左手拉弓。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:454
msgid "A hunter's clean hands: no ink."
msgstr "猎人的手很干净：没有墨迹。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:454
msgid "Rides in boots."
msgstr "穿靴子骑马。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:456
msgid ""
"Took it off an outlaws' camp on the forest road, for the Wardens' bounty. My scale says {pounds}. {price}. Gently: the mare spooks."
msgstr "从林间大道上的亡命徒营地缴来的，为了领巡守的赏金。我的秤上是{pounds}。{price}。轻点：母马容易受惊。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:457
msgid ""
"The outlaws won't be needing it. {pounds} on my scale, and I price by the pound: {price}."
msgstr "那帮亡命徒用不着它了。秤上是{pounds}，我按磅定价：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:458
msgid ""
"Found it in a wolf den. The wolves had eaten whoever was carrying it. {pounds} on my scale. {price}."
msgstr "在狼窝里找到的。带着它的人被狼吃了。秤上是{pounds}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:459
msgid ""
"Wolves don't hoard, but their dinners did. {pounds}, to the half pound. {price}. Easy with it: the mare."
msgstr "狼不囤东西，可它们的晚餐生前会囤。{pounds}，精确到半磅。{price}。轻着点：当心母马。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:460
msgid ""
"A huntress who takes the Wardens' bounties, and sells what the outlaws had. She weighs every chest on her game scale and prices it by the pound, so light things (spells, gems) come cheap. Her chests hang on a mare who bolts at a hard shake: take the weight of what you heard from the scale's, and what's left is what never stirred."
msgstr ""
"领巡守悬赏的女猎人，把亡命徒的东西拿来卖。她把每只箱子放在猎物秤上称，按磅数定价，所以轻的东西（法术、宝石）就很便宜。她的箱子驮在一匹母马身上，马一遇猛摇就会惊跑：从秤上的重量里减去你听到的东西的重量，剩下的就是从没被摇响的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:463
msgid "Good hunting."
msgstr "祝你狩猎顺利。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:464
msgid "The mare's restless. I'm off."
msgstr "母马不安分了。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:465
msgid "No matter. It'll sell at the next market."
msgstr "无所谓。下个集市就能卖掉。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:465
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "也行。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:466
msgid "Easy! You'll have the mare bolting."
msgstr "轻点！你会把母马吓跑的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:466
msgid "Steady."
msgstr "稳着点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:467
msgid "Easy! You've upset the mare, and me. Half again."
msgstr "轻点！你惊着了我的马，也惹恼了我。加价一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:471
msgid "Mother Sorrel"
msgstr "索蕾尔婆婆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:471
msgid "Sorrel"
msgstr "索蕾尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:474
msgid "To keep the Guild's axes out of the Old Wood."
msgstr "不让公会的斧头砍进古林。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:475
msgid "Fingers green from her herbs."
msgstr "手指被草药染得发绿。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:475
msgid "Goes barefoot, always."
msgstr "总是赤着脚。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:476
msgid ""
"The Old Wood let this one go. I slept beside it and dreamt of {dream}. The oaks whispered its price: {price}."
msgstr "古林放走了这一只。我在它旁边睡了一觉，梦见了{dream}。橡树低声说出了它的价钱：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:477
msgid ""
"Moss grew on it for a hundred years. Last night I dreamt of {dream}, and of a price: {price}."
msgstr "它身上长了一百年的青苔。昨夜我梦见了{dream}，也梦见了一个价钱：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:478
msgid ""
"The Old Wood's druid at Thornwick. Her price comes to her in a dream, and she always dreams true, in signs: of what the Wood warded in the chest, or else of the dearest thing in it. A magpie is coin, a thorn a weapon, a raven's wing a cloak, a river a potion, an owl a spell, a star a gem. If you can't hear what she dreamt of, it's warded: name it."
msgstr ""
"古林在荆棘镇的德鲁伊。她的价钱来自梦中，而她的梦总会应验，以征兆的形式出现：梦见的是古林在箱中用结界封住的东西，没有的话，就是箱里最贵重的东西。喜鹊是钱币，尖刺是兵器，渡鸦羽翼是斗篷，河是药水，猫头鹰是法术，星星是宝石。要是你听不到她梦见的东西，它就被结界封住了：说出它。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:481
msgid "As the Wood wills."
msgstr "一切顺从古林之意。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:481
msgid "The oaks approve."
msgstr "橡树们点头了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:482
msgid "The Wood is calling me home."
msgstr "古林在唤我回去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:483
msgid "The Wood is patient. So am I."
msgstr "古林很有耐心。我也是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:483
msgid "Then it wasn't meant for you. Not yet."
msgstr "那它本就不属于你。至少现在还不是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:484
msgid "Mind the moss, child."
msgstr "当心青苔，孩子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:484
msgid "The Wood felt that."
msgstr "古林感觉到了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:485
msgid "The Wood felt that, child. So will your purse."
msgstr "古林感觉到了，孩子。你的钱袋也会感觉到的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:489
msgid "Brother Cadoc"
msgstr "卡多克修士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:489
msgid "Cadoc"
msgstr "卡多克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:491
msgid ""
"Bread for the poor at the abbey gate, and the Unopened kept off its steps."
msgstr "让修道院门口的穷人有面包吃，也别让未启派踏上修道院的台阶。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:492
msgid ""
"From the crypt of Saint Ide, by the Abbot's leave. A firm shake, but not hard, please: the saints are resting. {price}, for the poor."
msgstr "出自圣伊德的墓穴，已得院长许可。稳摇即可，请别猛摇：圣徒们正在安息。{price}，为了穷人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:493
msgid ""
"A brother's reliquary, three hundred years asleep. I gave it a firm shake, as is seemly. {price} feeds the gate for a week."
msgstr "一位修士的圣物箱，沉睡了三百年。我按礼数稳摇了一下。{price}，够修道院门前的穷人吃上一周。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:494
msgid ""
"The almoner of the abbey of Saint Ide, selling the crypt's chests to feed the poor at its gate. He shakes a chest firmly and won't have it shaken hard (half again if you do), so the holy cloaks a crypt chest is full of never make a sound for him, and go unpriced."
msgstr ""
"圣伊德修道院的施赈修士，变卖墓穴里的箱子，好让修道院门前的穷人吃饱。他摇箱子用稳摇，也不许别人猛摇（你若猛摇，价格涨一半），所以墓穴箱子里满满的圣袍在他手里从不出声，也就没算进价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:497
msgid "Bless you. The gate eats tonight."
msgstr "愿你蒙福。今晚门前的穷人有饭吃了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:497
msgid "Saint Ide thanks you."
msgstr "圣伊德感谢你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:498 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:502
msgid "Brother! The saints! Half again, for the sacrilege."
msgstr "弟兄！圣徒们啊！亵渎圣物，价格涨一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:499
msgid "Forgive me, I'm due at vespers."
msgstr "请原谅，我得去做晚祷了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:500
msgid "Another day, perhaps. The poor are patient. They have to be."
msgstr "或许改日吧。穷人很有耐心。他们也只能耐心。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:500
msgid "Peace be with you."
msgstr "愿你平安。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:501
msgid "Brother! Gently!"
msgstr "弟兄！轻一点！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:501
msgid "Oh! Saint Ide preserve us."
msgstr "哦！圣伊德保佑。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:506
msgid "Corvin Tallow"
msgstr "科尔文·塔洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:506
msgid "Corvin"
msgstr "科尔文"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:509
msgid ""
"One more good season on the smugglers' road, and then a boat, and the sea."
msgstr "在走私小道上再干一个好季节，然后买条船，出海去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:510
msgid ""
"Packed in straw, so nothing clinked at the Wardens' toll. I gave it a firm shake. {price}, and no questions."
msgstr "塞满了稻草，过巡守关卡时一声都没响。我稳摇过了。{price}，什么都别问。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:511
msgid ""
"Came up the smugglers' road. Don't ask whose. The straw muffles everything, but I gave it a firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "从走私小道上来的。别问是谁的。稻草把声音全闷住了，不过我稳摇过。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:512
msgid ""
"Runs brandy and chests past the Wardens' toll on the forest road, every chest packed in straw so nothing clinks: everything in it needs a strength harder to stir, and cloaks and spells won't stir at all. A firm shake, never a drop, and smugglers love a false bottom. Haggles. Now and then a chest he carries isn't his to sell."
msgstr ""
"在林间大道上把白兰地和箱子偷运过巡守的关卡，每只箱子都塞满稻草，免得叮当作响：里面的东西都要多用一级力度才摇得响，斗篷和法术则怎么也摇不响。他只稳摇，从不摔箱子，而走私贩子最爱夹层。爱讨价还价。他带来的箱子，偶尔不归他卖。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:515
msgid "Pleasure. We never met."
msgstr "合作愉快。咱们从没见过。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:515
msgid "Done. Mind the Wardens."
msgstr "成交。当心巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:516
msgid "{price}, and you're robbing me."
msgstr "{price}，你这是在抢我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:516
msgid "Tch. {price}, final."
msgstr "啧。{price}，最后的价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:517
msgid "Hmph. Plenty of other buyers."
msgstr "哼。买家多得是。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:517
msgid "I've a wagon to catch."
msgstr "我还得赶马车。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:518
msgid "Your loss. I was never here."
msgstr "是你吃亏。我从没来过。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:518
msgid "Suit yourself. Forget my face."
msgstr "随你。忘了我这张脸。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:519
msgid "Quiet! Do you want the Wardens round?"
msgstr "小声点！你想把巡守招来吗？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:519
msgid "Easy. That's straw, not stone."
msgstr "轻点。里面是稻草，不是石头。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:520
msgid "Quiet, you fool! That noise will cost you."
msgstr "小声点，蠢货！这动静可得加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:524
msgid "Aunt Hesper"
msgstr "赫斯珀姑妈"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:524
msgid "Hesper"
msgstr "赫斯珀"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:527
msgid ""
"To marry off the whole county, and to know whose chests are whose: a matchmaker keeps every family's accounts."
msgstr "把全郡的人都撮合成亲，还要弄清哪只箱子是谁家的：媒婆可是每户人家的账都记着。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:528
msgid "Ink on her fingers from the marriage contracts."
msgstr "手指上沾着婚约的墨迹。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:528
msgid "Rides her pony in boots, village to village."
msgstr "穿着靴子骑小马，走村串乡。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:529
msgid ""
"A dowry, love, from a wedding that never was: {clue}, as ever. Shaken hard: {price}."
msgstr "一份嫁妆，亲爱的，那场婚事没办成：照例装着{clue}。猛摇过了：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:530
msgid ""
"The groom ran off to the Barrow. Her dowry: {clue}. Shaken hard: {price}. I've another match for her already."
msgstr "新郎跑去古冢了。她的嫁妆：{clue}。猛摇过了：{price}。我已经给她另说了一门亲。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:531
msgid ""
"Thornwick's matchmaker, selling dowries from weddings that never happened. A Thornwick dowry always holds coin for luck, a cloak for warmth and a potion for health, and a bride often wards one of the three: whichever you can't hear is the warded one. Hesper shakes hard and prices what she hears, never what's warded."
msgstr ""
"荆棘镇的媒婆，卖的是没办成的婚事留下的嫁妆。荆棘镇的嫁妆总装着求好运的钱币、保暖的斗篷和保健康的药水，新娘常会用结界封住其中一样：哪样你听不到，哪样就是被封住的。赫斯珀猛摇箱子，按听到的定价，从不算被封住的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:534
msgid "May it bring you luck."
msgstr "愿它给你带来好运。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:534
msgid "Mind you use it well, love."
msgstr "可要好好用它，亲爱的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:535
msgid "I've a match to make, love. Toodle-oo."
msgstr "我还要去说媒呢，亲爱的。回见啦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:536
msgid "Ah well. There's always another wedding."
msgstr "唉，算了。总会有下一场婚礼的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:536
msgid "Not to your taste? Nor was the groom to hers."
msgstr "不合你的口味？那新郎也不合她的口味。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:537
msgid "Mind the bride's things, love!"
msgstr "当心新娘的东西，亲爱的！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:537
msgid "Ooh! Careful."
msgstr "哎哟！小心。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:538
msgid "That's a bride's dowry, love! It'll cost you more now."
msgstr "那是新娘的嫁妆，亲爱的！现在得多付钱了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:542 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:542
msgid "Flick"
msgstr "弗利克"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:545
msgid ""
"To be paid, to be fed, and never to be caught. Runs chests for the Magpie."
msgstr "拿到钱，吃饱饭，永远不被抓。替喜鹊跑腿卖箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:546
msgid ""
"It came my way, didn't it. {price}, quick. I can't stand about, mister."
msgstr "它自己落到我手里的，懂吧。{price}，快点。我可不能在这儿傻站着，老板。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:547
msgid ""
"Don't ask where it's from and I won't ask what you'll do with it. {price}. Twenty seconds."
msgstr "你别问它打哪儿来，我也不问你拿它干什么。{price}。二十秒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:548
msgid "A {colour} chest for {price}. Cheap, 'cause I'm in a hurry. Yes or no?"
msgstr "一只{colour}宝箱，只要{price}。便宜卖，因为我赶时间。要不要？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:549
msgid ""
"A pickpocket of twelve who runs chests for the Magpie: cheap, priced by colour, and in a hurry (twenty seconds). Most of what Flick sells isn't Flick's to sell: lay a hand on it, and your mark goes cold. From Thornwick in, you can send for the Wardens."
msgstr ""
"十二岁的扒手，替喜鹊跑腿卖箱子：便宜，按颜色定价，还很赶时间（二十秒）。弗利克卖的东西大多不归弗利克卖：手一碰，你的钥纹就会发凉。从荆棘镇起，你就可以报告巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:551
msgid "Ta. Never saw you."
msgstr "谢啦。我可没见过你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:551
msgid "Done. I'm off."
msgstr "成交。我闪了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:552
msgid "Too slow, mister. I'm gone."
msgstr "太慢啦，老板。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:553
msgid "Someone'll have it."
msgstr "总有人要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:554
msgid "Oi! Quiet!"
msgstr "喂！小声点！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:554
msgid "Careful! People are looking."
msgstr "小心！有人在看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:555
msgid "Drop it again and the price goes up. And the Wardens come running."
msgstr "再摔一次，价钱就涨。巡守也会跑过来。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:561
msgid "Ilse Varrow"
msgstr "伊尔丝·瓦罗"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:561
msgid "Ilse"
msgstr "伊尔丝"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:564
msgid ""
"To be an archmage one day. Lately, to know what her mistress is building in the cellar."
msgstr "有朝一日当上大法师。最近还想知道，她师父在地窖里造的是什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:565
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme's clearing out the Arcanum stores. The tag says: packed, {clue}. She says {price}."
msgstr "大法师奥姆在清理秘法院的库房。标签上写着内装：{clue}。她说要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:566
msgid ""
"This one's from the third cellar. I can read the tag, at least: {clue}. {price}, my mistress says."
msgstr "这只是第三号地窖里的。标签我好歹认得：{clue}。{price}，是我师父说的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:567
msgid ""
"The Arcanum's apprentice, clearing its stores for her mistress. Every chest still has its packing tag, listing each kind of thing packed in it, and the archmages warded the most dangerous: a kind on the tag that you can't hear is warded. Prices by the chest's colour, as she's told."
msgstr ""
"秘法院的学徒，替她师父清理库房。每只箱子都还留着装箱标签，列出装进去的每一类东西，而大法师们把最危险的那件用结界封住了：标签上有、你却听不到的那一类，就是被封住的。她按吩咐，照箱子的颜色定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:570
msgid "Oh good! Don't tell my mistress I was nervous."
msgstr "太好了！别告诉我师父我刚才很紧张。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:570
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "谢谢！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:571
msgid "I'm late! She'll turn me into something."
msgstr "我要迟到了！她会把我变成什么东西的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:572
msgid "Oh. She won't be pleased."
msgstr "哦。她不会高兴的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:572
msgid "That's all right. There's a whole cellar of them."
msgstr "没关系。地窖里还有一整窖呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:573
msgid "Careful! Some of those are cursed!"
msgstr "小心！里面有些东西被诅咒了！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:573
msgid "Eep!"
msgstr "呀！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:574
msgid "She said to keep them in one piece! I'll have to ask more."
msgstr "她说过要保证它们完好无损！我只好多要些钱了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:578
msgid "Archmage Thessaly Orme"
msgstr "大法师特萨莉·奥姆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:578
msgid "Orme"
msgstr "奥姆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:580
msgid "To understand the Locking well enough to undo it."
msgstr "把大封锁研究透，透到能解开它。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:581
msgid ""
"From the Arcanum's oldest stores. {price}. Tell me exactly what's in it, and a third comes back to you."
msgstr "出自秘法院最古老的库房。{price}。把里面的东西说得分毫不差，我就退你三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:582
msgid ""
"A {colour} chest: {price}. Read it true, Keywright, and I'll return a third. I study how your kind hears."
msgstr "一只{colour}宝箱：{price}。判断准确，钥匠，我就退还三分之一。我在研究你们这类人是怎么听的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:583
msgid ""
"An archmage of the Arcanum who studies the Locking, and Keywrights. She prices by the chest's colour, and likes a wager: read her chest exactly right, every kind and every count, and she gives back a third of what you paid."
msgstr ""
"秘法院的大法师，研究大封锁，也研究钥匠。她按箱子的颜色定价，还喜欢打赌：把她的箱子判断得分毫不差，每一类、每个数目都对，她就退还你所付的三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:585
msgid "Let us see."
msgstr "且让我们看看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:585
msgid "We shall see what you heard."
msgstr "看看你都听出了什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:586
msgid "My engine won't build itself. Good day."
msgstr "我的机器可不会自己造好。告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:587
msgid "Prudent. Or timid. We shall never know."
msgstr "谨慎。或者说胆怯。我们永远无从知晓。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:587
msgid "Another time, Keywright."
msgstr "改日吧，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:588
msgid "Hm. Bold."
msgstr "嗯。真大胆。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:588
msgid "Fascinating. Do that again."
msgstr "有意思。再来一次。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:589
msgid ""
"That chest is older than your great-grandmother. A third more, I think."
msgstr "那只箱子比你曾祖母年纪还大。我看，得加三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:593
msgid "Durgan Ironhand"
msgstr "杜尔甘·铁手"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:593
msgid "Durgan"
msgstr "杜尔甘"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:595
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown, locked in the Royal Treasury since the Locking; and a buyer for dwarf-gold the Guild won't let him sell."
msgstr "铁根之冠，自大封锁起就锁在皇家宝库里；还有一个买家，肯收公会不许他卖的矮人金。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:596
msgid ""
"From the deep seam under Ironroot. Hard shake, with dwarf's hands. {price}. Not a coin of it to the Guild, mind."
msgstr "从铁根底下的深矿脉里挖出来的。用矮人的手劲猛摇过了。{price}。这钱一文也不归公会，听好了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:597
msgid ""
"From Ironroot hold, sealed since my great-great-grandmother's day. I gave it a proper shake. {price}."
msgstr "出自铁根要塞，从我曾曾祖母那辈起就封着。我结结实实地摇过了。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:598
msgid ""
"A dwarf trader of Ironroot Street, who knows a weapon when he hears one. He prices weapons in full, everything else at half, and takes every tinkle for a diamond. He shakes hard, and haggles."
msgstr "铁根街的矮人商人，兵器一听便知。他给兵器算全价，别的东西一律半价，还把每一声叮铃都当成钻石。他会猛摇，也会讨价还价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:600
msgid "Done. Back to the deep."
msgstr "成交。回地底去了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:600
msgid "Ha! Done."
msgstr "哈！成交。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:601
msgid "{price}. Any lower and I'll eat my helmet."
msgstr "{price}。再低我就把头盔吃了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:601
msgid "{price}, and that's stone-solid."
msgstr "{price}，这价钱硬如磐石。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:602
msgid "You take me for a fool? Good day."
msgstr "你当我是傻子？告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:603
msgid "Hmph. Your loss, surface-dweller."
msgstr "哼。是你吃亏，地表人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:603
msgid "Back down the mine with it, then."
msgstr "那就把它带回矿里去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:604
msgid "Ha! Dwarf-made. It'll take worse than that."
msgstr "哈！矮人造的。比这更狠的都经得住。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:604
msgid "Watch it."
msgstr "当心点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:605
msgid "Mind my stone-work! That'll cost you."
msgstr "当心我的石工活儿！这得加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:609 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1029
msgid "Lady Isaura Vell"
msgstr "伊索拉·维尔小姐"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:609
msgid "Isaura"
msgstr "伊索拉"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:612
msgid "To keep the Vell house standing, despite her brother's debts."
msgstr "撑住维尔家的门楣，哪怕弟弟欠下一身债。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:613
msgid "Grandmother's trick box. Her riddle's on the lid: \"{clue}\" {price}."
msgstr "祖母的机关盒。她的谜语就写在盒盖上：“{clue}”要价{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:614
msgid ""
"From the Vell strongroom, before my brother finds it: {price}. Grandmother's riddle: \"{clue}\""
msgstr "趁我弟弟还没发现，从维尔家密库里取出来的：{price}。祖母的谜语：“{clue}”"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:615
msgid ""
"A noblewoman of an old house gone poor, selling her grandmother's trick boxes before her brother can. Each lid has grandmother's riddle about one thing inside, and if she warded something, the riddle is about that. Solve it: if you can't hear the answer, it's warded. Prices by colour."
msgstr ""
"一位家道中落的世家小姐，赶在弟弟下手之前变卖祖母的机关盒。每只盒盖上都写着祖母的一则谜语，说的是盒里的某样东西；若祖母用结界封住了什么，谜语说的就是它。解开谜语：如果谜底的声音你听不到，它就被结界封住了。她看宝箱颜色定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:618
msgid "How delightful."
msgstr "真令人愉快。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:618
msgid "Grandmother would approve."
msgstr "祖母会赞许的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:619
msgid "I have creditors at four. Do excuse me."
msgstr "四点钟我还要应付债主。失陪了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:620
msgid "Pity. Grandmother so loved a puzzle."
msgstr "可惜。祖母最爱谜题了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:620
msgid "Another time, perhaps."
msgstr "也许下次吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:621
msgid "Goodness!"
msgstr "天哪！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:621
msgid "Do be careful, that's a Vell."
msgstr "务必小心，那可是维尔家的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:622
msgid "That is a Vell heirloom! The price has just gone up."
msgstr "那可是维尔家的传家宝！价钱刚刚涨了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:626
msgid "Silas Brass"
msgstr "赛拉斯·布拉斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:626
msgid "Brass"
msgstr "布拉斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:629
msgid "His money; and, though he'll never say it, to be thought kind."
msgstr "钱；还有——虽然他嘴上绝不会承认——被人当作好心人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:630
msgid ""
"Pledged twenty years ago on Lantern Lane and never redeemed. The ticket says {articles}. A firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "二十年前在灯笼巷典当的，一直没人来赎。当票上写着{articles}。稳摇过了。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:631
msgid ""
"Ticket four thousand and twelve: {articles}, it says. I price a lot kind by kind, at a firm shake. {price}."
msgstr "第四千零一十二号当票，上面写着：{articles}。这批货我按种类计价，稳摇听的。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:632
msgid ""
"The pawnbroker of Lantern Lane, selling pledges nobody redeemed, often two or three of a kind. He prices one of each kind he hears and never counts how many. The pawn ticket counts every article pledged, false bottom and all, and he won't have pledges dropped: count what you hear against the ticket."
msgstr ""
"灯笼巷的当铺老板，变卖没人赎回的当品，同一种东西常有两三件。他听到每种东西只算一件，从不数有几件。当票上记着典当的每一件物品，连夹层里的也算在内；他不许别人摔当品：拿你听到的和当票上的数目对一对。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:635
msgid "Done. No refunds."
msgstr "成交。概不退款。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:635
msgid "Sold, as heard."
msgstr "成交，听到什么就是什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:636 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:640
msgid "Not on my pledges! Half again, for the damage."
msgstr "别这样对我的当品！加价一半，算是赔偿。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:637
msgid "Time is money, and you're spending mine."
msgstr "时间就是金钱，你在花我的钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:638
msgid "Back on the shelf it goes."
msgstr "那就放回架子上。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:638
msgid "As you like. Pledges keep."
msgstr "随你。当品放得住。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:639
msgid "Mind the pledges!"
msgstr "当心那些当品！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:644
msgid "Master Quire"
msgstr "奎尔大师"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:644
msgid "Quire"
msgstr "奎尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:647
msgid ""
"The Chest Roll kept true. Lately, to know why it says the Guild's chests aren't the Guild's."
msgstr "让宝箱名册记载无误。最近，还想弄清名册上为何说公会的宝箱不归公会。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:648
msgid ""
"From the Royal Archive's vaults, with its ward-roll: {clue}. Unclaimed since the Locking. So much a rattle: {price}."
msgstr "出自皇家档案馆的地库，附有结界名录：{clue}。自大封锁以来无人认领。按响声计价，共{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:649
msgid ""
"The Chest Roll lists no owner for this one. The ward-roll reads {clue}, as far as I can make it out. I counted the rattles: {price}."
msgstr "宝箱名册上没有登记这只箱子的主人。就我辨认得出的，结界名录上写着：{clue}。我数过响声了：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:650
msgid ""
"The Royal Archivist, keeper of the Chest Roll, selling unclaimed vault chests with their ward-rolls. A roll names what was warded in its chest, its letters faded by three hundred years: read the name, and name its kind on your slip. A blank roll means nothing was warded. He counts the rattles at a firm shake and charges the same for each."
msgstr ""
"皇家档案官，宝箱名册的保管人，变卖地库里无人认领的宝箱，附带各自的结界名录。名录写着箱中被结界封住的东西，字迹经三百年已残缺不全：读出名字，在估价单上勾选它的种类。名录空白，就是没有东西被封住。他稳摇后数响声，每一声收一样的价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:653
msgid "Duly recorded."
msgstr "已如实登记。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:653
msgid "I'll enter it in the Roll."
msgstr "我会把它记入名册。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:654
msgid "The Archive closes at six. Good day."
msgstr "档案馆六点关门。告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:655
msgid "Very well. I'll file it under 'unsold'."
msgstr "好吧。我会把它归入“未售出”一类。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:655
msgid "Noted."
msgstr "记下了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:656
msgid "Careful! That's Crown property."
msgstr "小心！那是王室财产。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:656
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:657
msgid "That is Crown property! I'll have to add a fee for that."
msgstr "那是王室财产！我得为此加收一笔费用。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:661
msgid "Tilly Mudge"
msgstr "蒂莉·马奇"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:661
msgid "Tilly"
msgstr "蒂莉"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:664
msgid "To find the bell she hears tolling under the Aldwater on still nights."
msgstr "找到那口钟——每逢寂静的夜晚，她总听见它在奥德河底下鸣响。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:665
msgid ""
"Out of the Aldwater mud at low tide! I shook it hard, and I'd bet my boots on what rustles. {price}."
msgstr "退潮时从奥德河的淤泥里挖出来的！我猛摇过了，里头沙沙响的是什么，我敢拿靴子打赌。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:666
msgid ""
"The river gives and the river takes. Shook it hard: spellbooks, potions, who knows! {price}. Heard the bell again last night."
msgstr "河水有给就有拿。猛摇过了：法术书、药水，谁知道呢！{price}。昨晚又听见那口钟响了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:667
msgid ""
"A mudlark who combs the Aldwater at low tide, shakes hard, and prices every rustle as a drowned wizard's spellbook. Her scroll cases are often full of river sand, which pours at the gentlest shake. Real parchment only rustles at a hard one."
msgstr ""
"奥德河的河滩拾荒人，退潮时在泥里翻找。她会猛摇，把每一声沙沙都当作溺死的巫师留下的法术书来定价。她的卷轴筒里常常装满河沙，河沙轻摇就会流动作响。真正的羊皮纸只在猛摇时才会沙沙响。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:669
msgid "Mud's been good to me!"
msgstr "泥巴待我不薄！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:669
msgid "The river provides."
msgstr "河水自有馈赠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:670
msgid "Tide's turning. I'm off."
msgstr "要涨潮了。我走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:671
msgid "Back in the barrow, then."
msgstr "那就放回推车里吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:671
msgid "No skin off my nose."
msgstr "反正我又不吃亏。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:672
msgid "Ha! It's been through worse in the river."
msgstr "哈！它在河里经历过更糟的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:672
msgid "Oop!"
msgstr "哎哟！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:673
msgid "Oi! Mud or no mud, that's mine. It'll cost more now."
msgstr "喂！管它有泥没泥，那都是我的。现在得加钱了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:677
msgid "Sir Rowan Gale"
msgstr "罗文·盖尔爵士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:677
msgid "Rowan"
msgstr "罗文"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:679
msgid ""
"His grandfather's sword, and his family's hall back from the Guild, which foreclosed on it."
msgstr "找回祖父的剑，并从公会手里夺回被查封的家族宅邸。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:680
msgid ""
"A Gale war chest. If my grandfather's sword's in it, it's mine, and I'll pay you {fee} for it. The rest is yours for {price}."
msgstr "盖尔家的战备箱。若我祖父的剑在里面，它归我，我付你{fee}。其余的，{price}就归你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:681
msgid ""
"From the siege of Harrowgate. Any blade in it is my family's: {fee} for the best. {price} for the chest."
msgstr "哈罗盖特围城战留下的。里面的刀剑都属于我的家族：最好的那把，我出{fee}。整箱{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:682
msgid ""
"A knight without a war, whose family's hall the Guild foreclosed on. He's looking for his grandfather's sword. Prices by colour. If there are weapons in his chest, the best of them goes back to him for the price he names: value what's left."
msgstr ""
"一位无仗可打的骑士，家族宅邸被公会查封了。他在寻找祖父的剑。他看宝箱颜色定价。他的箱子里若有兵器，最好的那件要按他开的价归还给他：估一估剩下的东西值多少。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:684
msgid "Honour is satisfied."
msgstr "荣誉得以保全。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:684
msgid "For the Gales!"
msgstr "为了盖尔家族！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:685
msgid "I'm expected at the lists. Good day."
msgstr "比武场还等着我。告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:686
msgid "Then I shall keep looking."
msgstr "那我就继续找下去。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:686
msgid "Another chest, another day."
msgstr "改日再看别的箱子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:687
msgid "Have a care, sir!"
msgstr "当心点，阁下！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:687
msgid "Steady!"
msgstr "稳住！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:688
msgid "Have a care with my grandfather's things! It'll cost you."
msgstr "当心我祖父的遗物！这可要让你多破费了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:694 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:694
msgid "Tick"
msgstr "嘀嗒"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:697
msgid ""
"Errands run, gold gone down the Gate, and one day off in three hundred years."
msgstr "跑完差事，把金子送下大门，再休三百年来的头一天假。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:698
msgid ""
"Fresh through the Gate, from the Maw's own hoard. {price}. And the sand's already running, mortal."
msgstr "刚穿过大门送来的，出自巨口自己的宝藏。{price}。沙漏里的沙已经在往下流了，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:699
msgid "Errand for the Maw. A {colour} chest: {price}. Tick, tock."
msgstr "替巨口跑腿。{colour}宝箱一只：{price}。嘀嗒，嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:700
msgid ""
"An imp courier with an hourglass, selling from the Maw's hoard. Prices by colour and never looks inside, and gives you twelve seconds to decide. Things from the Maw's hoard are often better than their chest's colour."
msgstr "带着沙漏的小恶魔信使，贩卖巨口宝藏里的东西。看宝箱颜色定价，从不往里看，只给你十二秒做决定。巨口宝藏里的东西常常比宝箱颜色所示的更好。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:702
msgid "Delicious."
msgstr "美味。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:702
msgid "A pleasure, mortal."
msgstr "荣幸之至，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:703
msgid "Too slow! Back through the Gate I go."
msgstr "太慢了！我这就穿过大门回去啦。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:704
msgid "Pfft. Your loss, mortal."
msgstr "噗。是你吃亏，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:704
msgid "Fine. Someone in the Emporium has more sense."
msgstr "好吧。商行里总有更识货的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:705
msgid "Hee! Again!"
msgstr "嘻！再来！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:705
msgid "Clumsy mortal."
msgstr "笨手笨脚的凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:706
msgid "Careful, mortal! Breakages cost extra."
msgstr "小心点，凡人！摔坏了要加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:710
msgid "Lord Sallow"
msgstr "萨洛勋爵"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:710
msgid "Sallow"
msgstr "萨洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:712
msgid "To win every bargain he makes. He always has."
msgstr "赢下他做的每一笔交易。他向来如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:713
msgid ""
"From the Maw's hoard. {price}, a pittance. My only condition: the dearest thing inside is mine."
msgstr "出自巨口的宝藏。{price}，区区小数。我只有一个条件：里面最贵重的东西归我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:714
msgid ""
"A bargain, mortal: {price}. When it opens, I take the best of it. Everything else is yours."
msgstr "做笔交易吧，凡人：{price}。箱子打开时，最好的那件归我。其余的全归你。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:715
msgid ""
"A devil of the old law, who deals in bargains. His price is low, but the dearest thing inside is his. A chest of many middling things suits his deal; one grand thing and little else doesn't."
msgstr ""
"一个遵循古老律法的魔鬼，专做交易。他要价很低，但箱里最贵重的东西归他。箱里若是许多中等货色，这笔交易就划算；若只有一件珍品、别的寥寥无几，就不划算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:717
msgid "Signed and sealed."
msgstr "签字盖印，契约已成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:717
msgid "A pleasure doing business. It always is."
msgstr "合作愉快。向来如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:718
msgid "My time is worth more than yours, mortal."
msgstr "我的时间比你的值钱，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:719
msgid "Another time. There is always another time."
msgstr "下次吧。总会有下次的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:719
msgid "How very wise of you. Or was it?"
msgstr "你真是明智。还是说，并不明智？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:720
msgid "Mind my bones."
msgstr "当心我的骨头。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:720
msgid "Tsk."
msgstr "啧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:721
msgid "Damaged goods cost more, mortal. Read the small print."
msgstr "货物受损，价钱更高，凡人。看看契约上的小字吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:725 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:725
msgid "Skrae"
msgstr "斯克雷"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:728
msgid "Out: away from the Gate, and the Maw, for good. It has heard enough."
msgstr "离开——永远远离大门，远离巨口。它已经听够了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:729
msgid ""
"Shaken gently, then hard: {price}. Then I clicked, like a bat. The echoes: {clue}."
msgstr "先轻摇，再猛摇：{price}。然后我像蝙蝠那样咔嗒了几声。回声：{clue}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:730
msgid ""
"I hear every coin in the realm, and every word the Maw says. {price}. My echoes: {clue}. Wards can't stop an echo."
msgstr "这国度里的每一枚钱币、巨口说的每一个字，我都听得见。{price}。我的回声：{clue}。结界挡不住回声。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:731
msgid ""
"A demon with ears like a bat, who has heard enough of the Maw. It shakes a chest gently, then hard, and prices what it hears, fairly. Then it clicks and listens to the echoes, which come back off everything inside, warded or not: round is coin, long a weapon, soft a cloak, hollow a potion, flat a spell, tiny a gem. An echo you can't hear is warded."
msgstr ""
"一个长着蝙蝠耳朵的恶魔，受够了巨口。它先轻摇再猛摇宝箱，按听到的东西公道定价。然后它发出咔嗒声，聆听回声；回声会从箱内的每样东西上弹回，无论是否被结界封住：圆的是钱币，长的是兵器，软的是斗篷，空心的是药水，扁的是法术，小小的是宝石。回声里有、摇起来却听不到的东西，就是被结界封住的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:734
msgid "Fair."
msgstr "公道。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:734
msgid "You won't regret it. Probably."
msgstr "你不会后悔的。大概吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:735
msgid "I hear someone counting gold elsewhere."
msgstr "我听见别处有人在数金子。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:736
msgid "I heard that coming."
msgstr "我早就听出来了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:736
msgid "Hm. Fair enough."
msgstr "嗯。也行。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:737
msgid "Ow! My ears!"
msgstr "哎哟！我的耳朵！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:737
msgid "Loud. Very loud."
msgstr "吵。太吵了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:738
msgid "My ears! That will cost you."
msgstr "我的耳朵！这可要加钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:742
msgid "Countess Vey"
msgstr "维伯爵夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:742
msgid "the Countess"
msgstr "伯爵夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:745
msgid ""
"To keep up appearances at court, a jewel at a time. Some of her gems are paste, and she knows which."
msgstr "在宫中维持体面，一次卖一件珠宝。她的宝石有些是仿造的，她心里清楚是哪些。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:746
msgid "From my strongroom. My gems, and whatever my maid packed. {price}."
msgstr "出自我的密库。我的宝石，还有女仆随手装进去的东西。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:747
msgid ""
"The gems alone are worth {price}, I'm told. The rest I couldn't say. My maid packs."
msgstr "听说，光这些宝石就值{price}。其余的我可说不上来。箱子是女仆收拾的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:748
msgid ""
"A countess of the court who knows her own jewels and nothing else: she prices her gems at what she paid for them, and whatever else her maid packed comes free. Some of her gems are paste, and she won't have a lodestone near them (half again if you try)."
msgstr ""
"宫中的一位伯爵夫人，只认得自己的珠宝，别的一概不知：她按当初的买价给宝石定价，女仆装进去的其他东西都白送。她的宝石有些是仿造的，而且她不许磁石靠近它们（你若这么做，价格涨一半）。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:750
msgid "Charming."
msgstr "真迷人。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:750
msgid "Do look after them."
msgstr "请好好照料它们。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:751
msgid "A lodestone? On MY gems? Half again, for the insult."
msgstr "磁石？竟敢用在我的宝石上？加价一半，权当赔罪。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:752
msgid "I'm expected at court. Good day."
msgstr "宫中还等着我。告辞。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:753
msgid "How very disappointing."
msgstr "真是令人失望。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:753
msgid "Well. Someone at court will have it."
msgstr "好吧。宫里总有人要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:754
msgid "My gems!"
msgstr "我的宝石！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:754
msgid "Must you?"
msgstr "非得这样吗？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:755
msgid "My gems! Half again, for the fright."
msgstr "我的宝石！加价一半，算是压惊。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:759
msgid "Madame Zell"
msgstr "泽尔夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:759
msgid "Zell"
msgstr "泽尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:762
msgid ""
"To be right, and to be paid for it. The cards don't lie; Madame Zell doesn't either."
msgstr "说得准，还要为此拿钱。牌不会说谎，泽尔夫人也不会。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:763
msgid ""
"A courtier's chest, sold for his gambling debts. Three from the Locking's deck: {clue}. {price}."
msgstr "一位朝臣的箱子，为了还赌债卖掉的。从大封锁的牌里抽出三张：{clue}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:764
msgid ""
"The cards chose this one for you, dear. {clue}. A {colour} chest: {price}."
msgstr "牌为你选中了这一只，亲爱的。牌面：{clue}。{colour}宝箱一只：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:765
msgid ""
"The court's cartomancer. She draws three cards from the Locking's own deck for each chest: a suit drawn twice is what the ward holds (Coins, Swords for weapons, Mantles for cloaks, Cups for potions, Wands for spells, Stars for gems); three different suits, and nothing's warded. Prices by colour."
msgstr ""
"宫廷的纸牌占卜师。每只宝箱，她都从大封锁的那副牌里抽三张：某个花色出现两次，就是结界封住的东西（钱币即钱币，宝剑即兵器，斗篷即斗篷，圣杯即药水，权杖即法术，星辰即宝石）；三张花色各不相同，就没有东西被封住。她看宝箱颜色定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:768
msgid "The cards are never wrong."
msgstr "牌从不出错。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:768
msgid "As it was foretold."
msgstr "一如预言。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:769
msgid "The cards say I'm wanted elsewhere."
msgstr "牌说别处需要我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:770
msgid "The cards did say you might."
msgstr "牌确实说过你可能会这样。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:770
msgid "As you wish, dear."
msgstr "如你所愿，亲爱的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:771
msgid "I didn't see that coming. How rare."
msgstr "这我可没预见到。真难得。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:771
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr "哦！"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:772
msgid "The cards warned me about you. Half again."
msgstr "牌早就提醒过我要提防你。加价一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:776 scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:776
msgid "Gilt"
msgstr "吉尔特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:779
msgid ""
"The Maw's gilded iron sold as gold, so the Gate's gold buys more of the realm."
msgstr "把巨口的镀金铁器当黄金卖出去，好让大门那边的金子买下这国度更多的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:780
msgid ""
"Out of the Maw's hoard, friend, through a crack in the Gate. I'm leaving town tonight, so {price}."
msgstr "从巨口的宝藏里弄出来的，朋友，走的是大门的裂缝。我今晚就要出城，所以只要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:781
msgid ""
"Hoard goods, very rare. Gold and gems, every one of them. For you, just {price}."
msgstr "宝藏里的货，稀罕得很。全是黄金和宝石。给你，只要{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:782
msgid ""
"The Maw's fence. He knows exactly what's in his chests, because he packed the demon gold himself: gilded iron sold as gold and gems, cheap. What's real comes cheap; the fakes are worth nothing."
msgstr "巨口的销赃人。他对自己箱子里装着什么一清二楚，因为魔金就是他亲手装的：镀金的铁，冒充黄金和宝石廉价出售。真货卖得便宜；假货一文不值。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:784
msgid "Wonderful! No refunds."
msgstr "太好了！概不退款。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:784
msgid "A pleasure. I really must be going."
msgstr "荣幸之至。我真得走了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:785
msgid "Can't stay. People to avoid."
msgstr "不能久留。有些人我得躲着。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:786
msgid "Your loss, friend. Your very great loss."
msgstr "是你吃亏，朋友。吃了大亏。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:786
msgid "Suit yourself. I was never here."
msgstr "随你。我从没来过。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:787
msgid "Easy, friend! Easy."
msgstr "轻点，朋友！轻点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:787
msgid "Whoa there."
msgstr "悠着点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:788
msgid "Easy, friend! That'll cost a little extra."
msgstr "轻点，朋友！这得多收一点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:792
msgid "Old Aldo"
msgstr "老奥尔多"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:792
msgid "Aldo"
msgstr "奥尔多"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:795
msgid "A Keywright he can trust with the one chest that matters."
msgstr "找到一位能托付那只至关重要的宝箱的钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:796
msgid ""
"From an old house with a great many cellars. I've no idea what's in it. You tell me, and whatever you say it holds is my price."
msgstr "出自一座有许多地窖的老宅。我不知道里面有什么。你来告诉我：你说它装着什么，我就按什么要价。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:797
msgid ""
"Old things from an old house. Name what's inside: that's the price. Name it truly and I'll take a quarter off."
msgstr "老宅里的老物件。说出里面有什么：那就是价钱。说得分毫不差，我就减去四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:798
msgid ""
"A tired old man in a plain cloak, with a very fine ring. He doesn't know what's in his chests: his price is whatever your slip says. Read it exactly and he takes a quarter off; read it wrong and you pay what it really holds, and a quarter more."
msgstr ""
"一位披着朴素斗篷的疲惫老人，戴着一枚极为精美的戒指。他不知道自己的箱子里有什么：你的估价单写多少，他就要多少。判断分毫不差，他减去四分之一；判断错了，你就得按箱里实际的价值付钱，外加四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:800
msgid "Well. We shall see."
msgstr "好吧。拭目以待。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:800
msgid "Hm. Let's see what you heard."
msgstr "嗯。看看你听出了什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:801
msgid "I'm needed elsewhere. Another day."
msgstr "别处还需要我。改日吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:802
msgid "Another day, then. I'll be back."
msgstr "那就改日吧。我还会再来的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:802
msgid "Hm. A careful one. Good."
msgstr "嗯。是个谨慎的人。很好。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:803
msgid "Steady. It's older than both of us."
msgstr "稳着点。它比我们俩都老。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:803
msgid "Oh my."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:804
msgid "Steady! That was my grandfather's. I'll want a little more."
msgstr "稳着点！那是我祖父的东西。我得多要一点。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:808
msgid "Avarax, the Gilded Maw"
msgstr "镀金巨口阿瓦拉克斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:808
msgid "the Maw"
msgstr "巨口"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:811
msgid "Out."
msgstr "出来。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:812
msgid ""
"A trifle from my hoard. One coin. All I ask is that you open it here, where I can see."
msgstr "我宝藏里的一件小玩意儿。一枚金币。我只要你在这里打开它，让我看着。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:813
msgid ""
"One coin, little Keywright. And then everyone in this city will want twice as much today. Isn't that fun?"
msgstr "一枚金币，小钥匠。然后，今天这城里人人都会要双倍的价钱。是不是很好玩？"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:814
msgid ""
"The demon of greed himself, in a borrowed body dripping with rings. He sells a chest for one coin, but greed is catching: buy it, and everyone who comes to your counter after him that day asks twice as much."
msgstr "贪婪之魔本尊，借来的躯壳上戴满了戒指。他只要一枚金币就卖一只宝箱，但贪婪会传染：买下它，当天在他之后来到你柜台前的每个人都会要价翻倍。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:816
msgid "Yesss."
msgstr "好——"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:816
msgid "Open it. Let me see."
msgstr "打开它。让我看看。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:817
msgid "I have all the time in the world. You don't."
msgstr "我有的是时间。你可没有。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:818
msgid "Clever little thing."
msgstr "聪明的小东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:818
msgid "Mm. Another day, then. There are so many days."
msgstr "嗯。那就改日吧。日子还多着呢。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:819
msgid "Careful. I break things too."
msgstr "小心。我也会弄坏东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:819
msgid "Ha."
msgstr "哈。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:820
msgid "Careful. Greed always wants more."
msgstr "小心。贪婪永远想要更多。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:832
msgid "Sergeant Hollis"
msgstr "霍利斯中士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:832
msgid "Hollis"
msgstr "霍利斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:833
msgid ""
"Thieves caught and chests home; and to know why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open for anyone."
msgstr "抓住窃贼，让宝箱物归原主；还想弄清为什么公会查封的宝箱谁也打不开。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:834
msgid ""
"The Wardens' sergeant at the Thornwick toll: posts the wanted notices, searches the market, pays a finder's share for a stolen chest sent home."
msgstr "荆棘镇关卡的巡守中士：张贴悬赏告示，搜查集市，赃物宝箱物归原主时支付发现者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:838
msgid "Tobias Fenn"
msgstr "托拜厄斯·芬恩"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:838
msgid "Tobias"
msgstr "托拜厄斯"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:839
msgid "To know where the tithe goes, and not to vanish for asking."
msgstr "弄清贡金的去向，而且不会因为多问而人间蒸发。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:840
msgid ""
"A clerk in the Gilded Guild's counting-house, with ink to the elbows and doubts he shouldn't have."
msgstr "镀金公会账房里的书记员，墨水一直沾到手肘，心里还有些不该有的疑虑。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:844
msgid "Mistress Aubel"
msgstr "奥贝尔女士"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:844
msgid "Aubel"
msgstr "奥贝尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:845
msgid "Every marked child in the county, for the Guild's counting-houses."
msgstr "把郡里每一个带钥纹的孩子，都送进公会的账房。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:846
msgid ""
"A Guild Mark-Finder, who tests children's hands at every fair and takes the marked ones \"into the Guild's care\"."
msgstr "公会的寻纹人，在每一场集市上检查孩子们的手，把带钥纹的孩子带走，“交由公会照管”。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:850
msgid "Wynn Hollow"
msgstr "温·霍洛"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:850
msgid "Wynn"
msgstr "温"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:851
msgid "Her son kept out of the Guild's counting-houses."
msgstr "让儿子远离公会的账房。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:852
msgid "Pip's mother, the mill's washerwoman."
msgstr "皮普的母亲，磨坊的洗衣妇。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:856
msgid "Harl Caskett"
msgstr "哈尔·卡斯克特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:856
msgid "Caskett"
msgstr "卡斯克特"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:857
msgid "The Old Wood's oak, felled and sold, on the Guild's account."
msgstr "把古林的橡树砍倒卖掉，账记在公会名下。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:858
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild's timber factor, with a deed for the Old Wood and a pen for whoever will witness it."
msgstr "镀金公会的木材代理商，揣着一份古林的契据，还备好一支笔，等着谁来作见证。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:862
msgid "The Hawthorn Lady"
msgstr "山楂夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:862
msgid "the Hawthorn Lady"
msgstr "山楂夫人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:863
msgid "The Wood's oaks left standing; and a promise, kept."
msgstr "古林的橡树屹立不倒；还有，一个信守的承诺。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:864
msgid ""
"One of the fair folk of the Old Wood. She never used gold, and trades in promises."
msgstr "古林的仙灵之一。她从不使用金子，只用承诺做交易。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:868
msgid "Lord Cassian Vell"
msgstr "卡西安·维尔勋爵"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:868
msgid "Cassian"
msgstr "卡西安"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:870
msgid "Tonight's stake at cards. Tomorrow's, too."
msgstr "今晚牌桌上的赌本。明晚的也要。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:871
msgid ""
"Lady Isaura's brother, a gambler, selling his sister's chests cheap. They aren't his to sell."
msgstr "伊索拉小姐的弟弟，一个赌徒，正低价变卖姐姐的宝箱。那些箱子不归他卖。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:872
msgid "Splendid. The tables await."
msgstr "妙极了。牌桌在等着我。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:872
msgid "Done. Not a word to my sister."
msgstr "成交。别跟我姐姐提一个字。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:873
msgid "Your loss. Someone will want it before the cards start."
msgstr "是你吃亏。牌局开始之前，总会有人要的。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:873
msgid "Pity."
msgstr "可惜。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:877
msgid "Jory Kettle"
msgstr "乔里·凯特尔"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:877
msgid "Jory"
msgstr "乔里"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:878
msgid ""
"To pay you back for his freedom, and to see the Guild's debt-houses emptied."
msgstr "报答你还他自由，还想看到公会的债务监狱人去楼空。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:879
msgid "Ada's son, two years in the Guild's debt-house for his father's tithe."
msgstr "艾达的儿子，为了父亲欠的贡金，在公会的债务监狱里关了两年。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:913
msgid "a farmer at Brindle"
msgstr "布林德尔的一位农夫"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:913
msgid "the Crossed Keys"
msgstr "交钥酒馆"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:913
msgid "the miller's wife"
msgstr "磨坊主的妻子"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:914
msgid "a carter on the forest road"
msgstr "林间大道上的一位车夫"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:914
msgid "a Thornwick family"
msgstr "荆棘镇的一户人家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:914
msgid "the abbey's gatehouse"
msgstr "修道院的门房"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "a Crownhold merchant"
msgstr "王冠堡的一位商人"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "Lord Harrow's household"
msgstr "哈罗勋爵府上"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "a family on Lantern Lane"
msgstr "灯笼巷的一户人家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:915
msgid "a chapel by the Aldwater"
msgstr "奥德河畔的一座小教堂"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "a lady of the court"
msgstr "宫中的一位贵妇"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "a palace steward"
msgstr "一位王宫管事"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "a banker of the Emporium"
msgstr "皇家商行的一位银行家"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:916
msgid "a courtier's widow"
msgstr "一位朝臣的遗孀"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:930
msgid ""
"Gods! It just... burst open! Keep the singing thing, then. The rest is going home with me."
msgstr "天哪！它居然……自己迸开了！那会唱歌的玩意儿你留着吧。剩下的我带回家了。"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "one"
msgstr "一"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "two"
msgstr "两"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "three"
msgstr "三"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "four"
msgstr "四"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "five"
msgstr "五"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:932
msgid "six"
msgstr "六"

#: scripts/Core/Sellers.cs:935
msgid "{0} and {1}"
msgstr "{0}和{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:14
msgid "Bram's Stall"
msgstr "布拉姆的摊位"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:17 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:62
msgid "The Royal Emporium"
msgstr "皇家商行"

#: scripts/Core/Shop.cs:759
msgid ""
"Fished it out of the millpond this morning. I didn't shake it, it might break! Is {price} okay?"
msgstr "今天早上从磨坊池塘里捞上来的。我没摇它，怕摇坏了！{price}行吗？"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:51
msgid ""
"Mara, the last archmage of the Keyhold, and Bram's old partner. She's hunted the Aldric Key for twenty years."
msgstr "玛拉，钥堡最后的大法师，布拉姆的老搭档。她追寻奥德里克之钥已有二十年。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:52
msgid ""
"The Crown Chest. The King gives it to you: it's yours by right. Open it, Keywright."
msgstr "王冠宝箱。国王把它赐给了你：它理所当然归你。打开它吧，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:60 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:299
msgid "Mara"
msgstr "玛拉"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:61
msgid "King Aldric"
msgstr "奥德里克国王"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:64
msgid "The Magpie"
msgstr "喜鹊"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:71
msgid ""
"Good evening. {0}, Collector for the Gilded Guild. Every Keywright in Aldmark pays the Guild a tithe, to keep the Gate. Your uncle never paid a penny."
msgstr "晚上好。我是{0}，镀金公会的收账人。奥德马克的每一位钥匠都要向公会缴纳贡金，用以看守大门。令叔却从没付过一文钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:72
msgid ""
"Twenty years I opened chests for folk who couldn't afford a Guild Keywright! For pennies!"
msgstr "二十年来，我替请不起公会钥匠的乡亲们开箱子！只收几个铜板！"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:73
msgid ""
"Twenty years of tithe, Bram: {0}. The Guild will be reasonable. {1} payments, one a week, starting small: {2}, {3} nights from now."
msgstr "二十年的贡金，布拉姆：{0}。公会是讲道理的。分{1}次付清，每周一次，先从小数目开始：{3}晚之后，付{2}。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:74
msgid "Miss one, and the Guild seals the stall. Good evening, Keywright."
msgstr "漏缴一次，公会便会查封摊位。祝你晚安，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:75
msgid ""
"Every fifth night, then. Don't look like that: a good ear pays any debt. We'll talk in the morning."
msgstr "那就是每五晚一回了。别这副表情：耳朵灵，什么债都还得上。咱们明早再说。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:91
msgid ""
"Another season at the crossroads, {0}. The Guild hasn't come sniffing yet. Let's make the most of it."
msgstr "又在十字路口过一季了，{0}。公会还没嗅到风声找上门来。咱们抓紧时间好好干。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:92
msgid ""
"There you are, {0}! My mark's faded, but look at your hand: it's yours now. And so is the stall."
msgstr "你可来了，{0}！我的钥纹已经褪了，可你看看你的手：现在它归你了。这摊位也归你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:93
msgid ""
"Folk bring us chests nobody else can open. You buy one, it opens for you, and you sell what's inside. So listen before you buy: that's the whole trade."
msgstr "乡亲们把别人打不开的宝箱拿来找咱们。你买下一只，它就会为你打开，然后你把里面的东西卖掉。所以买之前先听：这行的门道全在这儿了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:97
msgid ""
"You've a right to know what these chests are. Three hundred years ago the Maw, Avarax, ruled this realm through its gold. Every coin was his eye."
msgstr "这些宝箱是怎么回事，你有权知道。三百年前，巨口阿瓦拉克斯借这国度的金子统治着它。每一枚钱币都是他的眼睛。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:99
msgid ""
"King Aldric and the archmages locked every treasure away and chained the Maw behind the Gilded Gate. The Locking, they called it. The chests are what's left."
msgstr "奥德里克国王和大法师们把所有财宝都锁了起来，又用锁链把巨口困在镀金之门后面。他们管这叫“大封锁”。这些宝箱就是留下来的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:101
msgid ""
"And this is my one secret: a shard of the Aldric Key, broken in four when the Locking was made. It's yours now. Don't let the Guild see it."
msgstr "还有，这是我唯一的秘密：奥德里克之钥的一块碎片。大封锁铸成之时，钥匙碎成了四块。现在它归你了。别让公会看见。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:103
msgid ""
"So you're Bram's kin. You have the mark, and his ear for a chest, they say. I have something your uncle has wanted for twenty years. Find me what I ask for, and it's yours."
msgstr "原来你就是布拉姆的亲族。听说你有钥纹，听宝箱的耳力也跟他一样好。我手上有样东西，你叔叔想要了二十年。替我找来我要的东西，它就归你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:108
msgid ""
"That's... a second shard. Where did she get it? Never mind. Never mind!"
msgstr "这是……第二块碎片。她从哪儿弄来的？算了。算了！"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:109
msgid "That woman in the hood. I know that voice. Hear her out."
msgstr "那个戴兜帽的女人。这声音我认得。听她把话说完。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:111
msgid ""
"My name is Mara. I was the last archmage of the Keyhold. Your uncle and I found the first shard together, a long time ago."
msgstr "我叫玛拉，是钥堡最后的大法师。很久以前，我和你叔叔一起找到了第一块碎片。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:113
msgid ""
"The whole Key opens the Crown Chest: King Aldric's own, with the heart of the Locking inside. The Guild doesn't want your gold. It wants that chest."
msgstr "完整的钥匙能打开王冠宝箱：那是奥德里克国王自己的宝箱，里面封着大封锁的核心。公会要的不是你的金子。它要的是那只宝箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:115
msgid ""
"Every tithe the Guild takes goes down through the Gilded Gate. The Maw is buying his way out, a coin at a time. And every chest you open loosens the Locking."
msgstr "公会收的每一笔贡金，都穿过镀金之门流了下去。巨口正一枚钱币一枚钱币地给自己赎身。而你每打开一只宝箱，大封锁就松动一分。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:118
msgid ""
"And that old fellow at the Emporium, the one with the ring? Look at the seal on it, {0}. That's the King. He's been testing you."
msgstr "还有商行里那个老头，戴戒指的那个？看看戒指上的印记，{0}。那就是国王。他一直在考验你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:119
msgid ""
"The King knows. He's looking for a Keywright he can trust with the Crown Chest. Be that Keywright."
msgstr "国王心里清楚。他在寻找一位能托付王冠宝箱的钥匠。去成为那位钥匠吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:121
msgid ""
"Vane's been asking about the shards. Whatever he offers you tonight, think hard."
msgstr "韦恩一直在打听碎片的事。今晚不管他给你开什么条件，都要好好想想。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:124
msgid ""
"The tithe is paid. But the Gate is hungry, and the Guild has decided you owe it something for its patience."
msgstr "贡金已经付清。但大门饥饿难耐，而公会认定：它这么有耐心，你总该有所表示。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:125
msgid ""
"They'll keep coming, and every week they'll want twice as much. Let's see how long we can make them wait."
msgstr "他们还会再来，而且每周要的都会翻倍。咱们看看能让他们等多久。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:136
msgid "Bram's welcome"
msgstr "布拉姆的欢迎"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:137
msgid "Bram's secret"
msgstr "布拉姆的秘密"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:139
msgid "The Guild's terms"
msgstr "公会的条件"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:144
msgid "{0} Bring me {1} {2}, and the next shard is yours."
msgstr "{0}{2}给我带来{1}，下一块碎片就归你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:144 scripts/Ui/NotebookView.cs:383
msgid "this week"
msgstr "本周内"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:144
msgid "before the Guild comes again"
msgstr "在公会再次上门之前"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:154
msgid "A note from the Hooded Woman: \"{0}\""
msgstr "兜帽女子留下的字条：“{0}”"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:156
msgid ""
"A note from the Hooded Woman: \"You gave them the shards. Now the Guild will have the Crown Chest. Pay your debt: it's all you have left.\""
msgstr "兜帽女子留下的字条：“你把碎片给了他们。现在公会要拿到王冠宝箱了。还清你的债吧：你只剩这件事可做了。”"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:158
msgid ""
"The last week of the tithe, and it's already paid: nobody's coming for anything this week."
msgstr "贡金的最后一周，而且已经付清了：这周不会有人来讨任何东西。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:159
msgid "The debt's last week. Pay this, and the stall is yours. Truly yours."
msgstr "还债的最后一周。付清这一笔，摊位就归你了。真真正正归你。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:165
msgid ""
"Something enchanted. The last shard was hidden with magic, and only magic will find it."
msgstr "一件附魔物品。最后一块碎片是用魔法藏起来的，只有魔法才能找到它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:168
msgid ""
"A spellbook. The Keyhold wrote down where it hid every shard, in spells only a Keyhold book can hold."
msgstr "一本法术书。钥堡把每一块碎片的藏处都记了下来，用的是只有钥堡之书才承载得了的法术。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:169
msgid ""
"A gem. The Key was set with them, and they remember where the rest of it went."
msgstr "一颗宝石。钥匙上曾镶着宝石，它们记得钥匙其余部分的去向。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:170
msgid ""
"Old coin. The Key-smiths were paid in it, and every coin was stamped with where they worked."
msgstr "古钱币。当年铸钥匠的工钱就是用它付的，每一枚上都印着他们干活的地方。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:171
msgid ""
"A blade. The Wardens who carried the shards away were buried with their swords."
msgstr "一把剑。当年护送碎片离开的巡守，下葬时都佩着自己的剑。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:176
msgid "Good. Here: the second shard. Don't let the Guild see it."
msgstr "很好。给你：第二块碎片。别让公会看见。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:177
msgid "The third shard. One more, and the Key is whole."
msgstr "第三块碎片。再有一块，钥匙就完整了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:178
msgid "The last shard. Bram will know what to do with it. So will I."
msgstr "最后一块碎片。布拉姆会知道该拿它怎么办。我也知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:184
msgid "Before you pay. The Guild knows about the Key. {0}, I hear."
msgstr "付钱之前，容我一言。公会知道钥匙的事。听说，你手上有{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:185
msgid ""
"Give them to me, and the Guild will forget half of tonight's tithe. Generous, no?"
msgstr "把它们交给我，公会就免掉今晚一半的贡金。很慷慨吧？"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:188
msgid " shard"
msgstr "块碎片"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:188
msgid " shards"
msgstr "块碎片"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:192
msgid ""
"A sensible choice. The Guild remembers its friends. So does its master."
msgstr "明智的选择。公会不会忘记它的朋友。它的主人也不会。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:193
msgid "Pity. The Guild remembers that too."
msgstr "真遗憾。这一点，公会也会记住的。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:200
msgid "{0} week early"
msgid_plural "{0} weeks early"
msgstr[0] "提前了{0}周"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:201
msgid "Before I've even come for it"
msgstr "我都还没上门来收呢"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:205
msgid ""
"All of it? Now? {0}. Then the Guild... has no further claim on Bram's stall."
msgstr "全部？现在？{0}。那么公会……对布拉姆的摊位，再无任何索求。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:206
msgid ""
"Free and clear, and ahead of time! Twenty years, and the stall is ours."
msgstr "无债一身轻，还提前了！二十年了，这摊位总算是咱们的了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:211
msgid "Free and clear! Twenty years, and the stall is ours."
msgstr "无债一身轻！二十年了，这摊位总算是咱们的了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:215
msgid ""
"And the Guild has the shards. Somewhere under the palace, they're looking for the Crown Chest. Let them look."
msgstr "只是碎片在公会手里。他们正在王宫底下的什么地方找王冠宝箱。由他们找去吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:217
msgid ""
"And we've {0} of the Key's {1} shards. Mara will keep asking: keep trading, and we may find the Crown Chest yet."
msgstr "钥匙的{1}块碎片，咱们已经有了{0}块。玛拉还会再来要东西的：接着做买卖，说不定咱们终究能找到王冠宝箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:219
msgid ""
"The Crown Chest can wait. The Key's not going anywhere, and neither are we."
msgstr "王冠宝箱可以等。钥匙跑不了，咱们也跑不了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:226
msgid "Bram. It's been a long time."
msgstr "布拉姆。好久不见。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:227
msgid "Mara. The Key. You found all of it."
msgstr "玛拉。钥匙……你全找齐了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:228
msgid ""
"Your kin did the finding. And the King has come himself, with the Crown Chest. Quickly: the Guild is a day behind us."
msgstr "是你的亲人找齐的。国王亲自来了，带着王冠宝箱。快：公会只比我们晚一天。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:229
msgid ""
"Three hundred years it's waited in my family, and not one of us could open it. It's yours by right now, Keywright. It opens for nobody else."
msgstr "它在我的家族中等了三百年，我们没有一个人能打开它。现在，它理所当然地归你了，钥匠。除了你，它不会为任何人开启。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:244
msgid ""
"The tune's in here. And your family knows every verse: all nine Heartsongs. Then we don't renew the Locking. We finish it."
msgstr "曲调就在这里面。而你们家知道每一段：全部九首心歌。那我们就不必重续大封锁了。我们要了结它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:245
msgid ""
"Listen. That's the Maw. Starving, with nothing left to want. The Gate's just a gate now."
msgstr "听。那是巨口。它在挨饿，再也没有什么可贪求的了。大门如今只是一道门而已。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:246
msgid ""
"And the chests, Mara. Every chest in Aldmark. They're opening. All of them, all at once."
msgstr "还有那些宝箱，玛拉。奥德马克的每一只宝箱。它们都在打开。全部，一齐打开。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:247
msgid ""
"The Guild has nothing to sell, and nothing to keep. Go home, Mister Vane."
msgstr "公会已经无物可卖，也无物可守。回家去吧，韦恩先生。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:248
msgid ""
"Three hundred years of treasure, back in the light. We're going to need a bigger stall."
msgstr "三百年的财宝，重见天日。咱们得换个更大的摊位了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:252
msgid ""
"Listen. The Gate's gone quiet. The Locking holds: another three hundred years, if we're lucky."
msgstr "听。大门安静下来了。大封锁依然稳固：运气好的话，还能再撑三百年。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:253
msgid ""
"King Aldric's own hoard, on our counter. The old man said it's ours to keep."
msgstr "奥德里克国王自己的宝藏，就摆在咱们柜台上。那老人家说，这些都归咱们了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:256
msgid ""
"The Locking was a song, in nine verses: nine Heartsongs, hidden in chests. If you ever hear one sing, keep it."
msgstr "大封锁本是一首歌，共有九段：九首心歌，藏在宝箱里。哪天你听到其中一首在唱，就收下它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:257
msgid ""
"Your family knows {0} of the nine Heartsongs. Find every verse, and the next Keywright won't renew the Locking. They'll finish it."
msgstr "九首心歌，你们家已经知道了{0}首。找齐每一段，下一位钥匠就不必重续大封锁，而能了结它。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:258
msgid ""
"The Guild will keep coming, you know. Debts are funny things. But now we can afford to make them wait."
msgstr "公会还会再来的，你知道。债这东西，就是这么古怪。不过现在，咱们有本钱让他们等着了。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:265
msgid ""
"{0} weeks, and every coin of the tithe paid. Let them have the building: they can't have the mark."
msgstr "{0}周，贡金一文不少，全都付清了。房子让他们拿去吧：钥纹他们可拿不走。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:266
msgid ""
"So soon? Well. We'll start again somewhere. A good ear is never broke for long."
msgstr "这么快？唉，好吧。咱们找个地方从头再来。耳朵好使的人，穷不了多久。"

#: scripts/Core/Story.cs:267
msgid ""
"{0} weeks. You did better than I ever did. We'll start again somewhere."
msgstr "{0}周。你比我当年强多了。咱们找个地方从头再来。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:62
msgid ", {0} or better"
msgstr "，{0}及以上"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:81
msgid "Goldsmith"
msgstr "金匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:81
msgid "Coin and gems"
msgstr "钱币与宝石"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:82
msgid ""
"Moneychangers and jewellers come your way: coin and gems turn up {0} more often, and they sell for {1} more."
msgstr "钱商和珠宝商纷纷上门：钱币与宝石出现的频率提高{0}，售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:86
msgid "Armourer"
msgstr "军械匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:87
msgid ""
"Soldiers, knights and dwarves come {0} more often, and weapons sell for {1} more."
msgstr "士兵、骑士和矮人上门的频率提高{0}，兵器售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:91
msgid "Apothecary"
msgstr "药剂师"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "{0}, and potions sell for {1} more."
msgstr "{0}，药水售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "Glass never breaks, dropped or forced"
msgstr "无论摔箱还是强行开锁，玻璃都不会碎"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:92
msgid "Glass is {0} less likely to break"
msgstr "玻璃破碎的几率降低{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:96
msgid "Spellkeeper"
msgstr "守咒人"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:97
msgid ""
"People trust you with secrets: chests are {0} likelier to have a false bottom, and spells sell for {1} more."
msgstr "人们放心把秘密托付给你：宝箱有夹层的几率提高{0}，法术售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:101
msgid "Cloakmaker"
msgstr "斗篷匠"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:102
msgid ""
"Fine drapery: your exhibition counts +{0}, and cloaks sell for {1} more."
msgstr "布料精美：你的展览值+{0}，斗篷售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "Keen Eye"
msgstr "慧眼"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "Perfect reads in a row"
msgstr "连续完美判断"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:106
msgid "perfect reads in a row"
msgstr "连续完美判断"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:108
msgid "A perfect read earns you a valuer's fee: {0} of what the chest held."
msgstr "完美判断能为你赚得鉴定费：宝箱所值的{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "Lucky Shop"
msgstr "幸运小店"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "Surprises"
msgstr "惊喜"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:112
msgid "things better than their chest"
msgstr "优于宝箱品质的物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:114
msgid ""
"Luck follows a lucky shop: everything you open is {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "好运眷顾幸运小店：你打开的每件物品品质提升一级的几率提高{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "Finder"
msgstr "寻宝人"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "False bottoms and wards"
msgstr "夹层与结界"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:118
msgid "hidden or warded things found"
msgstr "找到的夹层或结界物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:120
msgid ""
"Chests are {0} likelier to have a false bottom, and what you find under one or name in a ward sells for {1} more."
msgstr "宝箱有夹层的几率提高{0}；夹层里找到的、或在结界中说中的物品，售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "Haggler"
msgstr "议价高手"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "Chests talked down"
msgstr "砍价成功的宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:124
msgid "chests talked down or named a price for"
msgstr "砍价成功或自己定价的宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:126
msgid ""
"Word of a hard bargainer: hagglers and sellers who wait for an offer settle for {0} less."
msgstr "砍价高手的名声传开了：会讨价还价的卖家和等你出价的卖家，成交价降低{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "Arcanist"
msgstr "秘法师"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "Enchanted things found"
msgstr "找到附魔物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:130
msgid "enchanted things"
msgstr "附魔物品"

#: scripts/Core/Synergies.cs:132
msgid ""
"Mages seek you out: each thing is {0} likelier to be enchanted, and enchanted things sell for {1} more."
msgstr "法师们慕名而来：每件物品附魔的几率提高{0}，附魔物品售价提高{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:69
msgid ""
"Fished it out for you, master! It's yours: you taught me the trade. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "给你捞上来的，师父！它归你了：这门手艺是你教我的。一枚金币，图个吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:70
msgid ""
"From the millpond, and I didn't shake it. Well, a bit. One coin, for luck, like Bram says."
msgstr "从磨坊池塘里捞的，我没摇它。嗯，摇了一点点。一枚金币，图个吉利，布拉姆就是这么说的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:99
msgid "The Shut Chests"
msgstr "紧闭的宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:100
msgid ""
"Someone's stealing chests around Thornwick: the Magpie, whom nobody's seen. The Wardens want a name."
msgstr "有人在荆棘镇一带偷宝箱：是那个谁也没见过的喜鹊。巡守想要一个名字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:107
msgid ""
"Sergeant Hollis, Wardens of the Road, Thornwick post. Someone broke into the abbey crypt last night and took Saint Ide's reliquary chest: green, iron-bound, the saint's key on its lid."
msgstr "道路巡守荆棘镇哨所，霍利斯中士。昨晚有人闯进修道院地下墓穴，偷走了圣伊德的圣物箱：绿色，包着铁皮，盖上有圣徒的钥匙。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:109
msgid ""
"If it comes to your counter, you'll know it. A Keywright's mark goes cold on a chest that isn't the seller's to sell. Lay a hand on any chest and feel. Send for us, and the Wardens pay a finder's share."
msgstr ""
"要是它到了你的柜台上，你会知道的。卖家无权出售的宝箱，钥匠的钥纹一碰就会发凉。把手放在任何一只宝箱上，感受一下。报告我们，巡守会付你发现者分成。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:111
msgid ""
"He's right. Shake anything, and your mark tells you whose it is: warm, the seller's; cold, stolen. A stolen chest won't open for whoever buys it."
msgstr "他说得对。随便摇一摇，你的钥纹就会告诉你东西是谁的：发暖，是卖家的；发凉，是偷来的。赃物宝箱不管谁买下都打不开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:115
msgid "Wanted: Saint Ide's reliquary"
msgstr "悬赏：圣伊德的圣物箱"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:116
msgid ""
"Stolen from the abbey crypt: a green chest, iron-bound, with the saint's key on its lid. A finder's share for its return. Sergeant Hollis, Thornwick."
msgstr "修道院地下墓穴失窃：绿宝箱一只，铁皮包边，盖上有圣徒的钥匙。寻回归还者可得发现者分成。荆棘镇，霍利斯中士。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:118
msgid ""
"Hollis posted a notice: Saint Ide's reliquary chest has been stolen from the abbey."
msgstr "霍利斯贴出告示：圣伊德的圣物箱从修道院失窃了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:122
msgid "I'll send for you."
msgstr "我会报告巡守的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:122
msgid "Good. The Wardens remember their friends."
msgstr "很好。巡守不会忘记朋友。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:124
msgid "I don't work for the Wardens."
msgstr "我不替巡守办事。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:128
msgid "Then I'll be keeping an eye on your back room, Keywright."
msgstr "那我会盯着你的后屋的，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:138
msgid "the abbey of Saint Ide"
msgstr "圣伊德修道院"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:140
msgid ""
"A green one, iron-bound, with a pretty key on the lid. It came my way. {price}, quick."
msgstr "绿的，包着铁皮，盖上有把漂亮钥匙。碰巧落到我手里的。{price}，快点。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:142
msgid ""
"You bought the reliquary from Flick. It won't open: it's in your back room."
msgstr "你从弗利克手里买下了圣物箱。它打不开，现在放在你的后屋里。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:150
msgid ""
"Flick brought the reliquary, and you sent for the Wardens: it's gone home to the abbey."
msgstr "弗利克带来了圣物箱，你报告了巡守：它已经回到了修道院。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:155
msgid "Flick brought the reliquary, and you let it go. It's gone."
msgstr "弗利克带来了圣物箱，你放它走了。它从此下落不明。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:163
msgid ""
"Saint Ide's chest came home. The Wardens say it was your doing, Keywright. The abbey owes you, and it pays its debts: our restorers' bench is yours at half the price, whenever you want it."
msgstr "圣伊德的宝箱回家了。巡守说这是你的功劳，钥匠。修道院欠你一份情，而修道院有债必还：我们的修复工作台，你什么时候想要，都只收半价。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:166
msgid ""
"Flick sold you the saint's chest? Then it's in your back room, and it will never open for you. Give it back to us: the abbey pays the finder's share, and blesses your door."
msgstr "弗利克把圣徒的宝箱卖给你了？那它就在你的后屋里，永远不会为你打开。把它还给我们吧：修道院会付你发现者分成，还会为你的店门祝福。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:168
msgid ""
"The saint's chest is gone. Somewhere a Keywright will try to open it, and it won't, and they'll never know why. Pray for whoever has it."
msgstr "圣徒的宝箱没了。某个地方会有个钥匠想打开它，却怎么也打不开，永远不会知道为什么。为拿着它的人祈祷吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:173
msgid "Give it back (+{0}g)"
msgstr "归还（+{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:179
msgid "You gave the reliquary back to the abbey."
msgstr "你把圣物箱还给了修道院。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:180
msgid "Bless you. The saint will remember, and so will we."
msgstr "愿你蒙福。圣徒会记得的，我们也会。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:182 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1063 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:475
#: scripts/Phases/DayEndPhase.cs:361 scripts/Ui/SongReveal.cs:173
msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "留着它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:185
msgid "Then may it sit in the dark with you, Keywright."
msgstr "那就让它陪你待在黑暗里吧，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:202
msgid ""
"\"Keywright. The abbey's chest was my runner's mistake, and Flick has been told. I take back what the Guild took from families who couldn't pay its tithe, and I give it back to them. Leave me be, and I'll remember it. M.\" A black feather falls out of the letter."
msgstr ""
"“钥匠：修道院那只箱子是我手下跑腿的失误，弗利克已经挨过训了。公会从交不起贡金的人家夺走的东西，我把它们拿回来，还给那些人家。别来管我，这份情我会记着。——鹊”一根黑色羽毛从信里掉了出来。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:207
msgid "Burn it"
msgstr "烧掉它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:210
msgid "The feather curls up in the grate. Somewhere, somebody knows."
msgstr "羽毛在炉栅里蜷缩起来，化成了灰。某处，有人知道了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:212
msgid "Show it to Hollis"
msgstr "拿给霍利斯看"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:216
msgid "Hollis turns the feather over. \"Her calling card. She's close, then.\""
msgstr "霍利斯把羽毛翻过来看了看。“这是她留的记号。看来她就在附近。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:223
msgid ""
"Three more thefts this week, every one a chest the Guild had foreclosed on. A carter saw the thief: {0}."
msgstr "这周又出了三起盗窃，每一起偷的都是公会查封过的宝箱。一个车夫看见了那个贼：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:227
msgid "The carter's word"
msgstr "车夫的证词"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:227 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:228
msgid "A carter saw the Magpie: {0}."
msgstr "一位车夫看见了喜鹊：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:234
msgid ""
"Wardens say a goblin did the abbey! Nettle's cousin saw the thief on the burrow road: {0}. Not a goblin! Tell the sergeant."
msgstr "巡守说修道院是哥布林偷的！荨麻的表亲在地洞那条路上看见贼了：{0}。不是哥布林！你去告诉中士！"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:238
msgid "A goblin's word"
msgstr "哥布林的证词"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:238
msgid "Nettle's cousin saw the Magpie on the burrow road: {0}."
msgstr "荨麻的表亲在通往地洞的路上看见了喜鹊：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:239
msgid "Nettle's cousin saw the Magpie: {0}."
msgstr "荨麻的表亲看见了喜鹊：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:246
msgid ""
"The Magpie's bounty is up to {0}. We've three names: Bettany Crane at the Crossed Keys, Aunt Hesper the matchmaker, and Rook Varga, who's hunting the bounty herself."
msgstr "喜鹊的赏金已经涨到{0}了。我们有三个名字：交钥酒馆的贝塔妮·克雷恩、媒婆赫斯珀姑妈，还有鲁克·瓦尔加，她自己也在追这笔赏金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:248
msgid ""
"You've heard what the carter saw, and the goblin. You've met all three. Who is it?"
msgstr "车夫看到了什么，哥布林看到了什么，你都听说了。这三个人你也都见过。是谁？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:252
msgid "I won't name anyone"
msgstr "我谁也不指认"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:256
msgid "You wouldn't name anyone for the Magpie's bounty."
msgstr "你不肯为了喜鹊的赏金指认任何人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:257
msgid "Have it your way. The bounty stands, if you change your mind."
msgstr "随你吧。要是你改了主意，赏金一直有效。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:264
msgid ""
"\"You sent an innocent woman to the Wardens' cells, Keywright. I'll get her out. And thank you for the diversion: it kept the Wardens busy all week. M.\""
msgstr "“钥匠，你把一个无辜的女人送进了巡守的牢房。我会把她弄出来。还要谢谢你替我声东击西：巡守为此忙了一整周。——鹊”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:273
msgid ""
"A knock at the back door. A hooded woman: she lowers her hood, and smiles."
msgstr "后门传来敲门声。一个戴兜帽的女人：她放下兜帽，笑了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:274
msgid ""
"You didn't give them my name, Keywright. I'm grateful, and the Lockless pay their debts. Take this: from a Guild strongroom, so it's nobody's now but yours."
msgstr "你没把我的名字告诉他们，钥匠。我很感激，而无锁党有债必还。收下这个：从公会密库里拿的，所以如今它不属于任何人，只属于你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:281
msgid "The Magpie came to the back door: {0}. She left you {1}."
msgstr "喜鹊来到了后门：原来是{0}。她给你留下了{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:290
msgid "The Marked Child"
msgstr "钥纹之子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:291
msgid ""
"Pip Hollow has the Key-mark. The Guild's Mark-Finders take marked children into its counting-houses."
msgstr "皮普·霍洛身上有钥纹。公会的寻纹人会把带钥纹的孩子带进公会的账房。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:297
msgid ""
"Mister? My hand's been itching ever since I fished up that last chest. Look: there's a mark on it. Like a key. Like yours."
msgstr "老板？自从我捞上来上一只箱子，我的手就一直痒。你看：上面有个印记。像一把钥匙。跟你的一样。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:301
msgid "Tell him what it means"
msgstr "告诉他这意味着什么"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:304
msgid "Pip has the Key-mark, and you told him what it means."
msgstr "皮普有钥纹，你告诉了他这意味着什么。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:305
msgid "A Keywright? Me? Mum'll faint."
msgstr "钥匠？我？妈妈会晕过去的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:307
msgid "Tell him to keep it hidden"
msgstr "叫他藏好"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:309
msgid "Pip has the Key-mark. You told him to keep his hand in his pocket."
msgstr "皮普有钥纹。你叫他把手揣在兜里。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:310
msgid "In my pocket. Got it. Is it a bad thing, mister?"
msgstr "揣在兜里。知道了。这是坏事吗，老板？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:318
msgid ""
"Mistress Aubel, Mark-Finder for the Gilded Guild. We test the children's hands at the fair tomorrow. The Guild takes the marked ones into its care: they want for nothing, all their lives."
msgstr "我是奥贝尔女士，镀金公会的寻纹人。明天集市上，我们要检查孩子们的手。带钥纹的孩子由公会照管：他们一辈子衣食无忧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:320
msgid ""
"A Keywright knows the itch when it starts. If you know of a marked child, a name is worth {0} to the Guild."
msgstr "钥纹刚开始发痒时，钥匠是认得出来的。要是你知道哪个孩子有钥纹，一个名字对公会来说值{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:323
msgid "Pip Hollow, the millpond boy"
msgstr "皮普·霍洛，磨坊池塘边那个男孩"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:330
msgid "You gave the Mark-Finder Pip's name. The Guild took him into its care."
msgstr "你向寻纹人说出了皮普的名字。公会把他带去照管了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:331
msgid "The Guild thanks you. He'll be well looked after."
msgstr "公会感谢你。他会得到妥善照顾的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:333
msgid "None that I know of"
msgstr "据我所知没有"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:335
msgid "You told the Mark-Finder you knew of no marked child."
msgstr "你告诉寻纹人，你不知道有哪个孩子带钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:336
msgid "Hm. The fair will tell."
msgstr "嗯。到了集市自见分晓。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:344
msgid ""
"I'm Pip's mum. The Guild's men are going door to door, looking at children's hands. He told me what you are."
msgstr "我是皮普的妈妈。公会的人正挨家挨户地查孩子们的手。他跟我说了你是什么人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:345
msgid ""
"Will you hide him? He'd sleep in your back room and work for his keep, and he's a good boy. Please."
msgstr "你能把他藏起来吗？他可以睡在你的后屋，干活抵食宿，他是个好孩子。求你了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:348
msgid "He can stay, as my apprentice"
msgstr "他可以留下，当我的学徒"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:352
msgid "You took Pip on as your apprentice, and hid him in the back room."
msgstr "你收皮普做了学徒，把他藏在了后屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:353
msgid "Bless you. Oh, bless you."
msgstr "老天保佑你。哦，老天保佑你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:355
msgid "I can't risk it"
msgstr "我不能冒这个险"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:359
msgid "You wouldn't hide Pip. The Guild found him at the fair."
msgstr "你不肯藏皮普。公会在集市上找到了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:360
msgid "Then they'll find him. They always do."
msgstr "那他们会找到他的。他们总能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:367
msgid ""
"A knock after dark. \"Mistress Aubel. Open up, Keywright. We're told there's a marked child under your roof.\""
msgstr "天黑后有人敲门。“我是奥贝尔女士。开门，钥匠。有人告诉我们，你这屋檐下藏着一个带钥纹的孩子。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:372
msgid "There's no child here"
msgstr "这里没有孩子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:376
msgid "You turned the Mark-Finder away. Pip's your apprentice now."
msgstr "你把寻纹人打发走了。皮普现在是你的学徒了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:377
msgid "We'll see. The Guild is patient, Keywright."
msgstr "走着瞧。公会很有耐心，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:379
msgid "Take him"
msgstr "带他走吧"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:384
msgid "You let the Mark-Finder take Pip."
msgstr "你让寻纹人带走了皮普。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:385
msgid "A wise choice."
msgstr "明智的选择。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:389
msgid "The Guild still takes Bram's word"
msgstr "公会仍认布拉姆的担保"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:393
msgid ""
"Bram gave his word for you, and the Mark-Finder went away. Pip's your apprentice now."
msgstr "布拉姆为你作了担保，寻纹人走了。皮普现在是你的学徒了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:394
msgid "Bram's word. Very well. The Guild will remember it was spent on this."
msgstr "布拉姆的担保。很好。公会会记住，这份担保用在了这件事上。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:405
msgid "The Widow's Debt"
msgstr "寡妇之债"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:406
msgid ""
"Ada Kettle's son Jory is in the Guild's debt-house, and her husband's sword was pawned in Crownhold."
msgstr "艾达·凯特尔的儿子乔里被关在公会的债务监狱里，她丈夫的剑也在王冠堡被典当了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:413
msgid ""
"My boy Jory's in the Guild's debt-house in Crownhold, for his father's tithe: the Guild says Rafe owed it. Two years he's been in there."
msgstr "我儿子乔里被关在王冠堡的公会债务监狱里，就为了他父亲的贡金：公会说那是雷夫欠下的。他在里面已经两年了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:415
msgid ""
"And if you ever find Rafe's sword in a chest, dear, KETTLE on the blade... it was pawned when he died. I'd give anything to have it back."
msgstr "还有，孩子，要是你哪天在箱子里找到雷夫的剑，剑身上刻着“凯特尔”……他死后剑就被当掉了。只要能把它拿回来，我什么都愿意给。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:419
msgid "Ada Kettle seeks her husband's sword"
msgstr "艾达·凯特尔寻找亡夫之剑"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:420
msgid ""
"A soldier's sword with KETTLE on the blade, pawned in Crownhold years ago. Ada Kettle, at Brindle, would give anything for it."
msgstr "一把士兵的剑，剑身刻有“凯特尔”字样，多年前在王冠堡被典当。布林德尔的艾达·凯特尔愿不惜一切换回它。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:421
msgid ""
"Ada's son Jory is in the Guild's debt-house. Her husband Rafe's sword was pawned in Crownhold."
msgstr "艾达的儿子乔里被关在公会的债务监狱里。她丈夫雷夫的剑在王冠堡被典当了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:431
msgid ""
"A soldier's pledge, never redeemed. The ticket says \"Kettle: one sword, and sundries\". {articles} in all, it says. {price}."
msgstr "一位士兵的当品，一直没人赎回。当票上写着“凯特尔：剑一把，杂物若干”。上面说，一共{articles}。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:443
msgid ""
"You bought Silas Brass's pledge with Rafe Kettle's sword in it. Bram set the sword aside for Ada."
msgstr "你买下了赛拉斯·布拉斯那批装着雷夫·凯特尔之剑的当品。布拉姆把剑取出来，留给了艾达。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:445
msgid ""
"You passed on Silas Brass's pledge with Rafe Kettle's sword in it. Someone else will have it."
msgstr "你没有买赛拉斯·布拉斯那批装着雷夫·凯特尔之剑的当品。它会落到别人手里。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:450
msgid ""
"I came up to Crownhold to see Jory, and Bram sent word: you found Rafe's sword! Oh, dear. May I see it?"
msgstr "我上王冠堡来看乔里，布拉姆捎信来说：你找到了雷夫的剑！哦，天哪。我能看看吗？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:453
msgid "It's yours"
msgstr "它是你的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:456
msgid "You gave Ada her husband's sword."
msgstr "你把艾达亡夫的剑给了她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:457
msgid "Rafe's sword. Oh, Rafe. Thank you, dear. Thank you."
msgstr "雷夫的剑。哦，雷夫。谢谢你，孩子。谢谢你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:459
msgid "Sell it to her for what she has ({0}g)"
msgstr "按她手头的钱卖给她（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:463
msgid "You sold Ada her husband's sword for what she had."
msgstr "你按艾达手头的钱，把她丈夫的剑卖给了她。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:464
msgid "It's all I have, but it's his. Thank you."
msgstr "这是我全部的钱，可这是他的剑。谢谢你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:466
msgid "Sell it on ({0}g)"
msgstr "转卖出去（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:470
msgid "You sold Rafe Kettle's sword on."
msgstr "你把雷夫·凯特尔的剑转卖了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:471
msgid "Oh. Of course. It's yours to sell, I suppose."
msgstr "哦。当然。我想，它是你的，你有权卖掉。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:477
msgid "Ada, about Jory"
msgstr "艾达，为乔里的事"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:478
msgid ""
"The debt-house wants {0} for Jory, and I've saved half of it. If you could find the rest... he's a strong lad, and he'd work for you till it was paid."
msgstr "债务监狱要{0}才肯放乔里，我攒了一半。要是你能补上剩下的……他是个壮小伙子，会给你干活，直到还清为止。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:482
msgid "Pay the rest ({0}g)"
msgstr "付清余款（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:487
msgid ""
"You paid the rest of Jory's debt. He'll carry chests in for you for a week, to pay you back: one more customer a day."
msgstr "你付清了乔里剩下的债。他会帮你搬一周宝箱来报答你：每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:488
msgid ""
"Jory's free! He'll work a week for you to pay you back, dear. He'll carry anything."
msgstr "乔里自由了！他会给你干一周活来报答你，孩子。什么他都搬得动。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:490 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:559
msgid "I can't"
msgstr "我付不起"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:492
msgid "You couldn't pay Jory's debt."
msgstr "你没能替乔里还债。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:493
msgid "I understand, dear. I'll keep saving."
msgstr "我明白，孩子。我会继续攒钱的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:503
msgid "The Deep Door"
msgstr "深处之门"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:504
msgid ""
"Tobin has found a door at the bottom of the Barrow, sealed with the Key-mark."
msgstr "托宾在古冢底部发现了一扇门，门上封着钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:511
msgid ""
"There's a door at the bottom of the Barrow, Keywright: stone, with a keyhole shaped like your mark. Nobody's been through it since the Locking."
msgstr "古冢底下有一扇门，钥匠：石头做的，锁孔的形状和你的钥纹一模一样。自大封锁以来，没人进去过。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:513
msgid ""
"Stake me {0} for rope, lamps and two good men, and half of what's behind it is yours."
msgstr "你出{0}资助我，买绳子、灯，再雇两个好手，门后的东西分你一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:516
msgid "Here's the money ({0}g)"
msgstr "钱给你（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:520
msgid "Tobin, back from the Barrow"
msgstr "托宾，从古冢归来"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:521
msgid "You staked Tobin to go through the Barrow's deep door."
msgstr "你资助托宾去闯古冢的深处之门。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:522
msgid "You won't regret it. Four days, and I'll be back."
msgstr "你不会后悔的。四天后我就回来。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:524
msgid "Not this time"
msgstr "这次算了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:524
msgid "Someone at the Crossed Keys will stake me, then."
msgstr "那交钥酒馆总会有人资助我的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:536
msgid ""
"Behind the door: a vault nobody had touched since the Locking. Half's yours, like I said: this one, freely given. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "门后头是一座地库，自大封锁以来就没人碰过。说好的，一半归你：这只白送给你。一枚金币，图个吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:539
msgid ""
"Tobin came back from the deep door with a hoard, and gave you your half."
msgstr "托宾从深处之门后带回了一批宝藏，把你那一半给了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:540
msgid ""
"Tobin came back from the deep door with a hoard. You wouldn't take your half."
msgstr "托宾从深处之门后带回了一批宝藏。你不肯收下你那一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:547
msgid ""
"Tobin's men came back to the Crossed Keys without him. He's alive: they heard him calling, under a fallen arch past the door."
msgstr "托宾的人回到了交钥酒馆，可他没回来。他还活着：他们听见他在呼救，就在门后一道塌下来的拱门底下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:549
msgid ""
"A rescue wants a crew from Crownhold, and that's {0}. Nobody here has it, love."
msgstr "救人得从王冠堡请一队人来，要{0}。这儿谁也拿不出这笔钱，亲爱的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:552
msgid "Pay for the rescue ({0}g)"
msgstr "支付救援费用（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:555
msgid "Tobin, rescued"
msgstr "托宾，获救归来"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:556
msgid "Tobin was trapped past the deep door. You paid for his rescue."
msgstr "托宾被困在深处之门后面。你出钱救了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:557
msgid "I'll send for the crew tonight. Bless you, love."
msgstr "我今晚就去叫救援队。老天保佑你，亲爱的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:564
msgid "Tobin was trapped past the deep door, and there was no rescue."
msgstr "托宾被困在深处之门后面，没有人去救他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:565
msgid "Then I'll light a candle for him at the Crossed Keys."
msgstr "那我就在交钥酒馆为他点一支蜡烛吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:577
msgid ""
"You came for me. Half of what's behind that door is yours, freely given, and I'm never going down again. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "你来救我了。那扇门后的东西有一半归你，白送的；我再也不下去了。一枚金币，图个吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:583
msgid "Tobin came back alive, and gave you half of what was behind the door."
msgstr "托宾活着回来了，把门后的东西分了你一半。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:592
msgid "The Woodcutters"
msgstr "伐木人"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:593
msgid ""
"The Guild's buying the felling rights on the Old Wood, and wants a Keywright's mark on the deed."
msgstr "公会要买下古林的采伐权，还要一位钥匠在契据上按下钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:600
msgid ""
"Harl Caskett, timber factor for the Gilded Guild. The Guild's buying the felling rights on the Old Wood. The druids won't sign, so the deed wants a licensed Keywright's mark as witness."
msgstr "哈尔·卡斯克特，镀金公会的木材代理商。公会要买下古林的采伐权。德鲁伊们不肯签字，所以契据需要一位持证钥匠按下钥纹作见证。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:602
msgid ""
"Put your mark to it, and the Guild pays a witness's fee: {0}, a tenth of your next due."
msgstr "按下你的钥纹，公会就付你一笔见证费：{0}，相当于你下一笔应缴贡金的十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:605 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:661
msgid "Seal it"
msgstr "盖印"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:611
msgid "You put your mark to the Guild's deed for the Old Wood."
msgstr "你在公会的古林契据上按下了钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:612
msgid "A pleasure. The axes go in at the full moon."
msgstr "荣幸之至。月圆之时，斧头就会落下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:614 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:675 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:893
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr "拒绝"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:619
msgid "You wouldn't put your mark to the Guild's deed for the Old Wood."
msgstr "你不肯在公会的古林契据上按下钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:620
msgid "The Guild will find another Keywright. It always does."
msgstr "公会会另找一位钥匠的。它总能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:628
msgid ""
"You put your mark to Caskett's deed, child. The axes come at the full moon, and the Wood will remember whose mark it was."
msgstr "你在卡斯克特的契据上按了钥纹，孩子。月圆之时斧头就会落下，古林会记住那是谁的钥纹。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:630
msgid ""
"You wouldn't put your mark to Caskett's deed. The Hawthorn Lady has heard of it, and she would speak with you. Leave your back door unlatched tonight."
msgstr "你不肯在卡斯克特的契据上按钥纹。山楂夫人听说了，她想和你谈谈。今晚别闩后门。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:637
msgid ""
"The door opens on its own, and the shop smells of hawthorn. \"Keywright. The Guild will find another mark for its deed, unless the one who refused it keeps refusing.\""
msgstr "门自己开了，店里满是山楂花的气味。“钥匠。公会会为它的契据另找一枚钥纹，除非拒绝过的人一直拒绝下去。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:639
msgid ""
"\"Promise me you'll keep the Wood's oaks standing, and have this: a charm the Wood has kept since before the Locking. A promise to us is kept, or paid for.\""
msgstr "“向我承诺，你会让古林的橡树屹立不倒，然后收下这个：一件古林自大封锁之前就珍藏至今的护符。对我们许下的承诺，要么信守，要么付出代价。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:643
msgid "I promise"
msgstr "我保证"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:648
msgid ""
"You promised the Hawthorn Lady to keep the Wood's oaks standing. She gave you {0}."
msgstr "你答应山楂夫人，要保住古林的橡树。她送了你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:649
msgid "\"Kept, or paid for.\" She leaves {0} on the counter, and is gone."
msgstr "“要么信守，要么付出代价。”她把{0}留在柜台上，转眼就不见了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:651
msgid "I can't promise that"
msgstr "我无法保证"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:651
msgid ""
"\"Then we'll speak no more of it.\" The hawthorn smell is gone by morning."
msgstr "“那此事便不必再提。”到了早上，山楂花的香气已经散尽。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:657
msgid ""
"Last time, Keywright. The Guild will pay a fifth of your next due for your mark on the Wood's deed: {0}."
msgstr "钥匠，这是最后一次了。只要你在古林的契据上按下钥纹，公会就付你下一笔应缴贡金的五分之一：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:670
msgid " A promise broken: the Hawthorn Lady's charm is gone from your case."
msgstr "你背弃了诺言：山楂夫人的护身符从你的奇物匣里消失了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:672
msgid "You sealed the Guild's deed for the Old Wood after all."
msgstr "你最终还是在公会的古林契据上盖了印。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:673
msgid "Sensible. The axes go in tomorrow."
msgstr "明智。斧头明天就落下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:680
msgid "You refused the Guild's deed for the Old Wood a second time."
msgstr "你第二次拒绝了公会的古林契据。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:681
msgid "Then the Guild will remember it."
msgstr "那公会会记住这件事的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:688
msgid ""
"Hawthorn again, and a voice from nowhere: \"Twice you refused them. The Wood keeps its own.\" Something is left on the counter."
msgstr "又是山楂花香，还有一个不知从何而来的声音：“你两次拒绝了他们。古林不会亏待自己人。”柜台上多了一样东西。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:693
msgid "The Hawthorn Lady thanked you with {0}."
msgstr "山楂夫人送你{0}以表谢意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:702
msgid "The Parcel"
msgstr "包裹"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:703
msgid ""
"Corvin Tallow needs somewhere to keep a parcel for two nights, and the Wardens are searching the market."
msgstr "科尔文·塔洛要找个地方把一个包裹存放两晚，而巡守正在搜查集市。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:709
msgid ""
"A favour, Keywright. Keep this parcel in your back room two nights. Don't open it: it isn't yours, so it wouldn't anyway. {0} when I collect."
msgstr "帮个忙，钥匠。把这个包裹在你后屋放两晚。别打开：它不是你的，反正你也打不开。等我来取，给你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:713
msgid "Deal"
msgstr "成交"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:717
msgid "You're keeping Corvin's parcel in your back room."
msgstr "你把科尔文的包裹存在了后屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:718
msgid "Good. Two nights. Nobody needs to know."
msgstr "好。两晚。谁也不必知道。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:720 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1126 scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1135
msgid "No"
msgstr "不"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:720
msgid "Pity. Forget I asked."
msgstr "可惜。就当我没问。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:727
msgid ""
"Hollis at the door, after dark. \"We're searching every back room on the market tonight. Not yours: I told the lads you're a friend of the Wardens. Good night, Keywright.\""
msgstr "天黑后，霍利斯来到门口。“今晚我们要搜查集市上的每一间后屋。你的就免了：我跟弟兄们说过，你是巡守的朋友。晚安，钥匠。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:729
msgid ""
"Hollis at the door, after dark. \"Wardens. We're searching every back room on the market tonight.\" He comes out with Corvin's parcel. \"And what's this?\""
msgstr "天黑后，霍利斯来到门口。“巡守办事。今晚我们要搜查集市上的每一间后屋。”他拿着科尔文的包裹走了出来。“这是什么？”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:733
msgid "It's Corvin Tallow's"
msgstr "是科尔文·塔洛的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:740
msgid ""
"The Wardens found Corvin's parcel, and you told them whose it was. Corvin's gone from the market."
msgstr "巡守找到了科尔文的包裹，你告诉了他们是谁的。科尔文从集市上消失了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:741
msgid ""
"Contraband brandy, and a chest off the Guild's foreclosure list. Thank you, Keywright."
msgstr "走私的白兰地，还有一只公会查封清单上的宝箱。多谢了，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:743
msgid "It's mine"
msgstr "是我的"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:750
msgid ""
"The Wardens found Corvin's parcel. You said it was yours, and paid the fine."
msgstr "巡守找到了科尔文的包裹。你说那是你的，交了罚款。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:751
msgid "Contraband, Keywright. That's a fine of {0}, and it's confiscated."
msgstr "违禁品，钥匠。罚款{0}，东西没收。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:757
msgid "Corvin, for his parcel"
msgstr "科尔文，来取包裹"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:759
msgid ""
"My parcel, safe and sound. You're a friend, Keywright. Here's {0}, and something from my own pocket."
msgstr "我的包裹，完好无损。够朋友，钥匠。这是{0}，再加一点我自己掏腰包的心意。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:767
msgid "Corvin collected his parcel: he paid, and gave you {0}."
msgstr "科尔文取走了他的包裹：他付了钱，还送了你{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:776
msgid "The Foreclosures"
msgstr "查封风波"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:777
msgid ""
"Half the chests the Guild forecloses on won't open for any Keywright it sells them to."
msgstr "公会查封的宝箱有一半，不管卖给哪个钥匠都打不开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:784
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn, clerk at the Guild's counting-house. Forgive me: I've a question I can't ask at work."
msgstr "我是托拜厄斯·芬恩，公会账房的书记员。恕我冒昧：我有个问题，没法在公会里问。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:785
msgid ""
"Half the chests the Guild forecloses on won't open for any Keywright it sells them to. The ledgers say they're sent \"below\", unopened. Why won't they open?"
msgstr "公会查封的宝箱有一半，不管卖给哪个钥匠都打不开。账簿上说，它们原封不动地被送去了“下面”。它们为什么打不开？"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:789
msgid "Seizure isn't a sale: they're still the families'"
msgstr "查封不算买卖：宝箱仍归那些人家"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:792
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn asked why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open. You told him: they're still the families'."
msgstr "托拜厄斯·芬恩问你，为什么公会查封的宝箱打不开。你告诉他：宝箱仍归那些人家所有。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:793
msgid ""
"Then the Guild's been selling stolen chests. For a hundred years. Oh dear."
msgstr "那公会一直在卖赃物宝箱。卖了一百年。天哪。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:795
msgid "Ask the Guild"
msgstr "去问公会"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:797
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn asked why the Guild's foreclosed chests won't open. You sent him back to the Guild."
msgstr "托拜厄斯·芬恩问你，为什么公会查封的宝箱打不开。你让他回去问公会。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:798
msgid "I... yes. Of course. Forget I asked."
msgstr "我……是的。当然。就当我没问。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:806
msgid ""
"The Guild took my family's hall and sold its chests. I bought grandfather's war chest back, and it's mine to sell: it won't open for their Keywright. The sword's mine, for {fee}. The rest: {price}."
msgstr ""
"公会夺走了我家的宅邸，卖掉了里面的宝箱。我把祖父的战备箱买了回来，它是我的，我有权出售：公会的钥匠根本打不开它。剑归我，我付你{fee}。其余的：{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:808
msgid ""
"Sir Rowan sold you his grandfather's war chest, bought back from the Guild: it was his, so it opened for you."
msgstr "罗文爵士把他从公会买回的祖父战备箱卖给了你：箱子本来就是他的，所以它为你打开了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:814
msgid ""
"Master Quire, the Royal Archivist. Your clerk friend came to me. The Chest Roll agrees with you: every chest the Guild has seized is still in the families' names."
msgstr "我是奎尔大师，皇家档案官。你那位书记员朋友来找过我。宝箱名册印证了你的说法：公会查封的每一只宝箱，仍登记在原主人家的名下。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:816
msgid ""
"By the ward's own law the Guild has been selling stolen chests for a century, and sending the ones that won't open down through the Gate. I've made you a copy of the Roll."
msgstr "按结界自身的法则，一百年来公会一直在卖赃物宝箱，打不开的就从大门送下去。我给你抄了一份名册。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:820
msgid "I'll take it to the King"
msgstr "我会把它呈给国王"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:824
msgid ""
"Master Quire gave you a copy of the Chest Roll. You'll take it to the King."
msgstr "奎尔大师给了你一份宝箱名册的副本。你要把它呈给国王。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:825
msgid "The King. Yes. If anyone can make the Guild answer for it, he can."
msgstr "国王。对。如果有谁能让公会为此负责，那就是他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:827
msgid "Sell the copy to the Guild ({0}g)"
msgstr "把副本卖给公会（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:833
msgid ""
"You sold the copy of the Chest Roll to the Guild. Tobias Fenn hasn't been seen since."
msgstr "你把宝箱名册的副本卖给了公会。从那以后，再也没人见过托拜厄斯·芬恩。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:834
msgid "You'd... very well. It's yours to sell."
msgstr "你竟然……好吧。东西是你的，你有权卖。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:842
msgid ""
"Tobias at the back door, with a travelling bag. \"They know I talked. I'm leaving Crownhold tonight. Take this: a page from the Guild's own ledgers. Every tithe, and where it goes. 'Below.'\""
msgstr "托拜厄斯提着旅行包站在后门。“他们知道我说出去了。我今晚就离开王冠堡。拿着这个：公会自己账簿上的一页。每一笔贡金，还有它的去向。‘下面’。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:844
msgid ""
" Jory Kettle's with him: \"I'll swear to the King what the debt-house is full of.\""
msgstr "乔里·凯特尔也跟他在一起：“我会向国王作证，债务监狱里关的都是些什么人。”"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:849
msgid ""
"Tobias Fenn left Crownhold, and left you a page of the Guild's ledgers: where the tithe goes."
msgstr "托拜厄斯·芬恩离开了王冠堡，给你留下了公会账簿的一页：上面记着贡金的去向。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:854
msgid "The King, for the Roll"
msgstr "国王，为名册而来"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:856
msgid ""
"You've something for the Crown, I hear. The Roll, and a page of the Guild's own ledgers. Let me see."
msgstr "听说你有东西要呈给王室。名册，还有公会自己账簿上的一页。让我看看。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:857
msgid ""
"The Guild's been robbing my subjects in my name, and sending it to the Maw. My decree: the Guild's tithe on Keywrights is cut by a fifth, from tonight. Vane will be... displeased."
msgstr "公会一直打着我的名号掠夺我的子民，再把钱送给巨口。我的诏令：从今晚起，公会向钥匠征收的贡金削减五分之一。韦恩会……很不高兴的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:864
msgid "By the King's decree"
msgstr "奉国王诏令"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:864
msgid ""
"The Gilded Guild's tithe on Keywrights is cut by a fifth. Aldric IX, Rex."
msgstr "镀金公会向钥匠征收的贡金削减五分之一。此令。国王奥德里克九世"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:865
msgid ""
"The King cut the Guild's tithe by a fifth. The Guild will remember who brought him the Roll."
msgstr "国王把公会的贡金削减了五分之一。公会会记住是谁把名册呈给了他。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:874
msgid "The Unlocking"
msgstr "大解封"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:875
msgid ""
"Archmage Orme is building an engine to copy the Key-mark: any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "大法师奥姆正在打造一台复制钥纹的机器：有了它，任何宝箱都能为任何人打开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:881
msgid ""
"My mistress, Archmage Orme, asks a favour: one drop of a Keywright's blood, on a brass plate. That's all. She'll pay {0}."
msgstr "我师父，大法师奥姆，想请你帮个忙：在一块黄铜板上滴一滴钥匠的血。就这些。她会付{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:885
msgid "Give it"
msgstr "给她一滴血"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:890
msgid "You gave Archmage Orme a drop of your blood on a brass plate."
msgstr "你在一块黄铜板上滴了一滴血，交给了大法师奥姆。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:891
msgid "Thank you! She'll be so pleased. I think."
msgstr "谢谢！她一定会很高兴的。我想是吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:896
msgid "You wouldn't give Archmage Orme your blood."
msgstr "你不肯把血给大法师奥姆。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:897
msgid "Oh. She'll find someone else. She always does."
msgstr "哦。她会去找别人的。她总能找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:903
msgid "Ilse, worried"
msgstr "伊尔丝，忧心忡忡"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:906
msgid ""
"Your blood's in her engine. She's building something to copy the mark: with it, any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "你的血用在了她的机器里。她在造一样能复制钥纹的东西：有了它，任何宝箱都能为任何人打开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:907
msgid ""
"She found another Keywright's blood. She's building an engine to copy the mark: any chest would open for anyone."
msgstr "她找到了别的钥匠的血。她在造一台复制钥纹的机器：有了它，任何宝箱都能为任何人打开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:908
msgid ""
"Mara came to the Arcanum last night. She says if the mark can be copied, the Locking's finished, and the realm with it. I don't know what to do."
msgstr "昨晚玛拉来了秘法院。她说要是钥纹能被复制，大封锁就完了，整个王国也会跟着完蛋。我不知道该怎么办。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:912
msgid "Help her break it"
msgstr "帮她毁掉它"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:917
msgid ""
"You helped Ilse break Orme's engine. She gave you {0} from the Arcanum's stores."
msgstr "你帮伊尔丝毁掉了奥姆的机器。她从秘法院库房里拿了{0}送给你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:918
msgid ""
"Then I'll do it tonight. Take this, from the stores: {0}. She'll never miss it."
msgstr "那我今晚就动手。拿着这个，库房里的：{0}。她绝不会发现少了它。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:920
msgid "Tell the Guild"
msgstr "告诉公会"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:926
msgid ""
"You told the Guild about Orme's engine. They took her away, and paid you."
msgstr "你把奥姆的机器告诉了公会。他们把她带走了，还付了你钱。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:927
msgid "The Guild? Oh no. Oh, no."
msgstr "公会？哦不。哦，不。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:929
msgid "Stay out of it"
msgstr "置身事外"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:932
msgid "You stayed out of Orme's engine."
msgstr "你没有插手奥姆的机器。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:933
msgid "I... all right. I'll stay out of it too."
msgstr "我……好吧。我也不插手了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:941
msgid ""
"It works, Keywright. Partly: one chest in three opens for anyone at all. The Guild has offered me the moon for it."
msgstr "它成了，钥匠。只是部分成功：每三只宝箱里就有一只，谁都能打开。公会为它向我开出了天价。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:942
msgid ""
"And the Gate is cracking: the Maw's gilded iron is leaking into every purse in the realm. Here: {0}, your share, for the blood."
msgstr "而且大门正在开裂：巨口的镀金铁正渗进王国里的每一个钱袋。拿着：{0}，这是你那滴血应得的一份。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:947
msgid ""
"Orme's engine works, partly, and the Gate is cracking: demon gold is everywhere now, in any purse of coin."
msgstr "奥姆的机器部分奏效了，大门也在开裂：如今魔金无处不在，任何一袋钱币里都可能有。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:956
msgid "Ironroot's Crown"
msgstr "铁根之冠"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:957
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown was locked in the Royal Treasury at the Locking, and the Guild bans dwarf-gold."
msgstr "大封锁时，铁根的王冠被锁进了皇家宝库，而公会禁止矮人金流通。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:964
msgid ""
"At the Locking, the King's men locked Ironroot's crown in the Royal Treasury with everything else. Three hundred years it's sat there."
msgstr "大封锁那会儿，国王的人把铁根的王冠跟别的东西一起锁进了皇家宝库。它在那儿一搁就是三百年。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:966
msgid ""
"The Guild calls our gold contraband because we won't pay its tithe. If the crown came home, every dwarf in Ironroot would remember who brought it."
msgstr "就因为我们不交它的贡金，公会就把我们的金子叫作违禁品。要是王冠能回家，铁根的每个矮人都会记得是谁把它带回来的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:970
msgid "I'll ask the King"
msgstr "我去求国王"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:974
msgid "You told Durgan you'd ask the King for Ironroot's crown."
msgstr "你告诉杜尔甘，你会去向国王讨回铁根的王冠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:975
msgid "Ha! A surface-dweller with a spine. We'll see."
msgstr "哈！有骨气的地表人。走着瞧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:977
msgid "Nothing I can do"
msgstr "我无能为力"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:977
msgid "Hmph. Nobody ever can."
msgstr "哼。从来没人能。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:988
msgid ""
"Ironroot's crown? It's in a chest I can't open, like everything I own. Here: I give it to you. Keep what else is in it, and give the dwarves their crown."
msgstr "铁根的王冠？它在一只我打不开的宝箱里，就跟我拥有的一切一样。给，我把它送给你。里面别的东西归你，王冠就还给矮人吧。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:996
msgid ""
"The King gave you the chest with Ironroot's crown in it. Bram set the crown aside for the dwarves."
msgstr "国王把装着铁根王冠的宝箱送给了你。布拉姆把王冠单独收好，留给矮人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1002
msgid ""
"The crown! Ironroot owes you a debt it won't forget, Keywright. Our smiths will build you what you need, for nothing."
msgstr "王冠！铁根欠你一份永世不忘的人情，钥匠。我们的工匠会免费为你打造你需要的东西。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1010
msgid "Ironroot's smiths built you a {0}, for nothing."
msgstr "铁根的工匠们免费为你打造了{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1010
msgid "Ironroot paid you for the crown in dwarf-gold."
msgstr "铁根用矮人金为王冠酬谢了你。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1019
msgid "The Vell Inheritance"
msgstr "维尔家的遗产"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1020
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian Vell is selling his sister's chests, and they aren't his to sell."
msgstr "卡西安·维尔勋爵正在变卖他姐姐的宝箱，可那些宝箱轮不到他来卖。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1031
msgid ""
"Grandmother's trick box. I need it gone before the tables open tonight: {price}, and not a word to my sister."
msgstr "祖母的机关盒。今晚牌桌开张之前，我得把它脱手：{price}，别跟我姐姐提一个字。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1034
msgid ""
"You bought a trick box from Lord Cassian. It won't open: it's his sister's."
msgstr "你从卡西安勋爵手里买了一只机关盒。它打不开：那是他姐姐的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1039
msgid ""
"Lord Cassian tried to sell you his sister's trick box. You sent for the Wardens."
msgstr "卡西安勋爵想把他姐姐的机关盒卖给你。你报告了巡守。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1040
msgid "Lord Cassian tried to sell you his sister's trick box. You passed."
msgstr "卡西安勋爵想把他姐姐的机关盒卖给你。你没有买。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1047
msgid ""
"My brother sold you grandmother's box. It's mine, by her will, so it won't open for you. Give it back to me, and I'll give it to you properly. Then it will."
msgstr "我弟弟把祖母的盒子卖给了你。按她的遗嘱，那是我的，所以它不会为你打开。把它还给我，我再正式送给你。那样它就会打开了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1050
msgid ""
"Cassian spent a night in the Wardens' cells over grandmother's box. It did him good. Thank you, Keywright."
msgstr "为了祖母的盒子，卡西安在巡守的牢房里蹲了一晚。这对他有好处。谢谢你，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1051
msgid ""
"Cassian sold one of grandmother's boxes to someone. It will never open for them, and he knows it."
msgstr "卡西安把祖母的一只盒子卖给了别人。它永远不会为那人打开，这一点他心知肚明。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1055
msgid "Give it back"
msgstr "归还"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1060
msgid "You gave Lady Isaura her grandmother's box back."
msgstr "你把祖母的盒子还给了伊索拉小姐。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1061
msgid ""
"Thank you. I'll bring it back tomorrow: freely given, it'll open for you."
msgstr "谢谢你。我明天把它带回来：诚心相赠，它就会为你打开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1066
msgid "You kept Lady Isaura's box."
msgstr "你留下了伊索拉小姐的盒子。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1067
msgid "Then it sits in your back room forever. How very Vell of you."
msgstr "那它就永远躺在你的后屋里吧。你这做派，倒真像我们维尔家的人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1079
msgid "Isaura, with grandmother's box"
msgstr "伊索拉，带着祖母的盒子"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1081
msgid ""
"Grandmother's box, freely given. Now it's yours, and it will open. One coin, for luck: she'd have insisted."
msgstr "祖母的盒子，诚心相赠。现在它是你的了，它会打开的。收你一枚金币，图个吉利：她老人家一定会坚持这么做的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1082
msgid "Lady Isaura gave you grandmother's box, and it opened."
msgstr "伊索拉小姐把祖母的盒子送给了你，它打开了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1094
msgid ""
"Grandmother's last trick box. Her riddle: \"{clue}\" Whoever names her heart may keep it. {price}."
msgstr "祖母的最后一只机关盒。她的谜语：“{clue}”谁能道出她的心头所爱，谁就能留下它。{price}。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1095
msgid ""
"Grandmother's last trick box, and you gave me the first one back. Her riddle: \"{clue}\" Whoever names her heart may keep it. One coin, for luck."
msgstr "祖母的最后一只机关盒，而你把第一只还给了我。她的谜语：“{clue}”谁能道出她的心头所爱，谁就能留下它。收你一枚金币，图个吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1099
msgid "You bought grandmother Vell's last trick box."
msgstr "你买下了维尔祖母的最后一只机关盒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1107
msgid "The Defector"
msgstr "叛逃者"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1108
msgid "Skrae has heard enough of the Maw, and wants out."
msgstr "斯克雷听够了巨口那一套，想要脱身。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1115
msgid ""
"I've heard enough of the Maw, Keywright. Every word he says to the Guild, I hear. I want out."
msgstr "巨口的话我听够了，钥匠。他对公会说的每一个字，我都听得见。我要脱身。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1116
msgid ""
"Hide me in your back room three nights, and I'll tell you what I've heard. You'll want to know."
msgstr "把我藏在你的后屋三晚，我就把听到的告诉你。你会想知道的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1119
msgid "Hide it"
msgstr "把它藏起来"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1123
msgid "You hid Skrae in your back room."
msgstr "你把斯克雷藏在了后屋。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1124
msgid "Three nights. I'll be quiet. I'm very good at quiet."
msgstr "三晚。我会很安静。安静我最在行了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1126
msgid "Then I'll go back. Forget you saw me."
msgstr "那我就回去。就当你没见过我。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1132
msgid ""
"Seen a demon with bat's ears? Ran off from the Gate. The Maw pays {0} for runaways. Tick, tock."
msgstr "见过一个长着蝙蝠耳朵的恶魔吗？从大门那边逃出来的。巨口悬赏{0}，捉拿逃跑的家伙。嘀嗒，嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1137
msgid "Tick came looking for Skrae. You said nothing."
msgstr "嘀嗒来找斯克雷。你什么也没说。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1138
msgid "Tick, tock. We'll find it."
msgstr "嘀嗒，嘀嗒。我们会找到它的。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1140
msgid "In my back room ({0}g)"
msgstr "就在我的后屋（{0}金）"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1145
msgid "You gave Skrae up to Tick, for the Maw's reward."
msgstr "为了巨口的赏金，你把斯克雷交给了嘀嗒。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1146
msgid "Delicious. The Maw thanks you, mortal."
msgstr "美味。巨口感谢你，凡人。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1155
msgid ""
"They've stopped looking. Here's what I heard: the Maw's gaze is greed, and greed only catches where there's gold on show. Keep your counter bare when he comes, and his gaze slides right off."
msgstr "他们不找了。我听到的是这样：巨口的目光就是贪婪，而贪婪只盯得住摆在明面上的金子。他来的时候把柜台收拾干净，他的目光就会直接滑开。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1157
msgid ""
"And this, from his hoard. He won't miss it. Goodbye, Keywright. I'm going somewhere quiet."
msgstr "还有这个，从他的宝藏里拿的。他不会发现少了。再见，钥匠。我要去个清静的地方了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1163
msgid ""
"Skrae went free. The Maw's gaze won't touch your counter again, and it left you {0}."
msgstr "斯克雷重获自由，临走时留给你{0}。巨口的目光再也不会落到你的柜台上了。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1217
msgid "she held the lantern in her right hand and the crowbar in her left"
msgstr "她右手提着灯笼，左手握着撬棍"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1218
msgid "she left inky fingermarks all over the gate"
msgstr "她在门上留下了一片沾墨的指印"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1219
msgid "she went over the wall in riding boots, and rode off"
msgstr "她穿着马靴翻过墙头，骑马跑了"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1234
msgid ""
"You named {0}, and she was the Magpie. The Guild's foreclosed chests went home to their families."
msgstr "你指认了{0}，她正是喜鹊。公会查封的宝箱都送回了原来的人家。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1235
msgid ""
"We found her hoard under {0}: every chest the Guild foreclosed on this year. They're going home. Here's your bounty."
msgstr "她的藏宝找到了，就在{0}底下：公会今年查封的每一只宝箱都在。它们要物归原主了。这是你的赏金。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1240
msgid ""
"You named {0} for the Magpie. The Wardens took her in. They found nothing."
msgstr "你指认{0}就是喜鹊。巡守把她抓了起来，却什么也没找到。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1241
msgid "Then we'll take her in. If you're wrong, Keywright, it's on your head."
msgstr "那我们就把她抓起来。要是你错了，钥匠，这笔账就算在你头上。"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1246
msgid "the Crossed Keys' cellar"
msgstr "交钥酒馆的地窖"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1247
msgid "a hayloft full of wedding chests"
msgstr "一座堆满嫁妆箱的干草棚"

#: scripts/Core/TaleBook.cs:1248
msgid "her hunting lodge in the Old Wood"
msgstr "她在古林里的狩猎小屋"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:24
msgid "The commons"
msgstr "平民"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:25
msgid "The Gilded Guild"
msgstr "镀金公会"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:26
msgid "The Wardens"
msgstr "巡守"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:27
msgid "The Lockless"
msgstr "无锁党"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:28
msgid "The Crown"
msgstr "王室"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:29
msgid "The abbey"
msgstr "修道院"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:30
msgid "The Old Wood"
msgstr "古林"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:31
msgid "The Arcanum"
msgstr "秘法院"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:32
msgid "Ironroot"
msgstr "铁根"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:38
msgid ""
"Farmers, innkeepers, widows and children: everyone who pays the tithe by selling what their grandparents left them."
msgstr "农夫、旅店老板、寡妇和孩子：所有靠变卖祖辈遗物来交贡金的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:39
msgid ""
"It licenses Keywrights, takes the tithe, lends to the Crown and forecloses on debtors."
msgstr "它给钥匠颁发执照，收取贡金，借钱给王室，还查封欠债人的家产。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:40
msgid ""
"The road-wardens: tolls, the peace, the Chest Roll, and every stolen chest."
msgstr "道路巡守：掌管过路费、治安、宝箱名册，还有每一只赃物宝箱。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:41
msgid ""
"Thieves, fences, smugglers and hedge-wrights. Their queen is the Magpie."
msgstr "窃贼、销赃人、走私贩和黑钥匠。他们的女王是喜鹊。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:42
msgid "King Aldric IX, his court, and a treasury he can't spend."
msgstr "国王奥德里克九世、他的宫廷，以及一座他花不掉的宝库。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:43
msgid "The abbey of Saint Ide at Thornwick, its relics and its almoners."
msgstr "荆棘镇的圣伊德修道院，以及它的圣物和施赈修士。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:44
msgid ""
"The fair folk and the druids, who trade in favours and keep their promises."
msgstr "仙灵和德鲁伊，他们以人情做交易，也信守承诺。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:45
msgid "Crownhold's college of archmages, licensed by the Guild."
msgstr "王冠堡的大法师学院，持有公会颁发的执照。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:46
msgid "The dwarves, who forge the locks and won't pay the Guild's tithe."
msgstr "矮人，他们打造锁具，却不肯交公会的贡金。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:52
msgid "hated"
msgstr "仇视"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:53
msgid "a foe"
msgstr "敌对"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:54
msgid "wary"
msgstr "戒备"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:55
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "陌生"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:56
msgid "warm"
msgstr "友善"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:57
msgid "a friend"
msgstr "友好"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:58
msgid "an ally"
msgstr "盟友"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:64
msgid "They send their neighbours: one more customer a day."
msgstr "他们会介绍邻居来光顾：每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:64
msgid "They stay away: one customer fewer a day."
msgstr "他们不再上门：每天少一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:65
msgid "It overlooks a twentieth of every due."
msgstr "公会网开一面：每笔应缴贡金减免二十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:65
msgid "It audits you: a twentieth more on every due."
msgstr "公会查你的账：每笔应缴贡金多收二十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:66
msgid "Hollis warns you before a search, and returns pay a third more."
msgstr "霍利斯会在搜查前提醒你，归还宝箱的报酬也多出三分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:67
msgid ""
"They search your back room every Guild night: what's stolen is taken, and you're fined."
msgstr "每个公会之夜，他们都会搜查你的后屋：赃物一律没收，你还要被罚款。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:68
msgid "Nim's friends pay half what a back-room chest cost you, not a quarter."
msgstr "尼姆的朋友会按你买后屋宝箱所花的一半收购，而不是四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:69
msgid "They rob you on the third night of every week: a tenth of your purse."
msgstr "他们每周第三晚都会来抢你：抢走你钱袋里的十分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:70
msgid "Their people offer their tools a quarter cheaper."
msgstr "他们的人卖工具给你，便宜四分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:70
msgid "Their people ask half as much again for their tools."
msgstr "他们的人卖工具给你，要贵一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:91 scripts/Phases/OpeningPhase.cs:762 scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:79
#: scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:174
msgid "Go on"
msgstr "继续"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:125 scripts/Phases/DuesPhase.cs:328 scripts/Phases/PeddlerPhase.cs:100
#: scripts/Phases/TalkPhase.cs:174
msgid "Good night"
msgstr "晚安"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:677
msgid ""
"Wardens. Open up. We've a warrant for your back room, and we'll be back with one every Guild night until you give us a reason not to."
msgstr "巡守。开门。我们有你后屋的搜查令，往后每个公会之夜都会带着搜查令再来，除非你给我们一个不来的理由。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:680
msgid "{0} that aren't yours, and a fine of {1}. Good night, Keywright."
msgstr "查出{0}不是你的，罚款{1}。晚安，钥匠。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:680
msgid "{0} chest"
msgid_plural "{0} chests"
msgstr[0] "{0}只宝箱"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:681
msgid "Nothing this time. The fine's {0} all the same: for our trouble."
msgstr "这回什么也没搜到。不过罚款照样是{0}：算我们跑这一趟的辛苦费。"

#: scripts/Core/Tales.cs:700
msgid ""
"The back shutter's been forced. {0} gone from the strongbox, and a black feather on the counter. The Lockless don't forget a Keywright who sets the Wardens on them."
msgstr "后窗板被人撬了。钱箱里少了{0}，柜台上还留着一根黑羽毛。哪个钥匠放巡守去抓无锁党，他们可不会忘。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:40
msgid "Move to Thornwick"
msgstr "迁往荆棘镇"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:40
msgid ""
"A shop at Thornwick Market: 6 customers a day, better chests, locks, and two new sounds: potions and spells."
msgstr "在荆棘镇集市开店：每天6位顾客，宝箱更好，开始出现锁，还有两种新声音：药水和法术。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:43
msgid "Painted Sign"
msgstr "彩绘招牌"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:43
msgid "One more customer every day."
msgstr "每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:44
msgid "Brass Scales"
msgstr "黄铜天平"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:44
msgid ""
"Honest weights, Warden-stamped, draw buyers who pay for them: everything sells for a fifth more."
msgstr "巡守盖过戳的公道砝码，能吸引肯为此掏钱的买家：所有东西售价提高五分之一。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:45
msgid "Oak Cabinet"
msgstr "橡木柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:45
msgid "Room to display one more thing. Displays draw customers."
msgstr "可多陈列一件物品。陈列能吸引顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:46
msgid "Fine Lockpicks"
msgstr "精良撬锁器"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:46
msgid "Goblin picks: a wider sweet spot when you pick a lock."
msgstr "哥布林做的撬锁器：撬锁时的绿区更宽。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:47
msgid "Oak Dresser"
msgstr "橡木橱柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:48
msgid "Restorer's Bench"
msgstr "修复工作台"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:48
msgid ""
"Everything you buy gets cleaned and mended: each thing is 5% likelier to come out a step better than its chest."
msgstr "你买下的每样东西都会被清洗修补：每件物品比宝箱品质高一级的几率提高5%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:50
msgid "Move to Crownhold"
msgstr "迁往王冠堡"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:50
msgid ""
"A shop in the capital: richer customers, archmages with enchanted things, a dwarf, and gems."
msgstr "在都城开店：顾客更阔绰，有带着附魔物品的大法师、一位矮人，还有宝石。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:53 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:598
msgid "Witchlight"
msgstr "巫灯"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:53
msgid ""
"Always lit: anything enchanted glows when it makes a sound. Nobody else can see it."
msgstr "长明不灭：任何附魔物品发出声响时都会发光。别人都看不见。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:54
msgid "Town Crier"
msgstr "传令员"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:54
msgid "Your name, shouted across Crownhold: one more customer every day."
msgstr "你的名号响彻王冠堡：每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:55
msgid "Auction Block"
msgstr "拍卖台"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:55
msgid ""
"Buyers bid against each other for what you sell: everything fetches 30% more."
msgstr "买家们争相为你的货出价：所有东西售价提高30%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:56
msgid "Glass Cabinet"
msgstr "玻璃柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:57
msgid "Crownhold Charter"
msgstr "王冠堡特许状"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:57
msgid "Two synergies at once."
msgstr "可同时启用两个羁绊。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:58
msgid "Curio Case"
msgstr "奇物匣"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:58 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:76
msgid "Room for one more curio."
msgstr "多一个奇物栏位。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:59
msgid "Glass Case"
msgstr "玻璃展柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:60
msgid "Restorer's Workshop"
msgstr "修复工坊"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:60
msgid ""
"A workshop and a journeyman: everything is another 6% likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "一间工坊和一名帮工：每件物品品质高一级的几率再提高6%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:62
msgid ""
"By the Gilded Gate: 5 customers a day, the court, demons, and a fence for the Maw."
msgstr "紧邻镀金之门：每天5位顾客，有宫廷中人、恶魔，还有替巨口销赃的人。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:65 scripts/Phases/CounterPhase.cs:811
msgid "Lodestone"
msgstr "磁石"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:65
msgid "Iron can't move near it: no clanking, and demon gold goes quiet."
msgstr "铁器在它附近动弹不得：不会有哐啷声，魔金也会哑然无声。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:66
msgid "Gilded Cabinet"
msgstr "镀金柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:67
msgid "Royal Seal"
msgstr "皇家印玺"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:67
msgid "Three synergies at once."
msgstr "可同时启用三个羁绊。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:68
msgid "Gilded Case"
msgstr "镀金展柜"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:71
msgid "Night Market"
msgstr "夜市"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:71
msgid "Open after dark: one more customer every day."
msgstr "入夜后照常营业：每天多一位顾客。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:72
msgid "Royal Warrant"
msgstr "皇家认证"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:72
msgid "By appointment to the Crown: everything sells for half as much again."
msgstr "王室御用：所有东西售价提高一半。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:73
msgid "Patrons' Book"
msgstr "委托人名册"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:73
msgid "The regulars post two more commissions a week."
msgstr "常客每周多发布两个委托。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:74
msgid "Master Restorer"
msgstr "修复大师"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:74
msgid ""
"A master of the craft, from the palace workshops: everything is another 8% likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "来自王宫工坊的修复大师：每件物品品质高一级的几率再提高8%。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:76
msgid "Velvet Case"
msgstr "天鹅绒匣"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:79
msgid "Nim's Lantern"
msgstr "尼姆的灯笼"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:79
msgid ""
"A lantern over the back door, so Nim knows he's welcome: one more curio on his table every night."
msgstr "在后门上挂一盏灯笼，让尼姆知道这里欢迎他：他的桌上每晚多摆一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:81
msgid "A Stool for Nim"
msgstr "给尼姆的凳子"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:81
msgid ""
"Somewhere to sit by the counter: Nim stays longer, and lays out one more curio a night."
msgstr "柜台边给他个坐的地方：尼姆会多待一会儿，每晚多摆出一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:83
msgid "Nim's Standing Order"
msgstr "尼姆的长期订单"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:83
msgid ""
"A standing order: Nim keeps the best of his pack for you, one more curio a night."
msgstr "长期订单：尼姆会把货包里最好的留给你，每晚多一件奇物。"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:87
msgid "Bookkeeping Engine"
msgstr "记账机"

#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:87
msgid ""
"The Guild's clockwork reads every chest on your counter and ticks the slip for you. Costs all you owe."
msgstr "公会的发条机械会读出你柜台上的每只宝箱，替你勾好估价单。价格是你欠下的全部债务。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:116
msgid "I've come back. {0}, and no hard feelings."
msgstr "我又回来了。{0}，之前的事一笔勾销。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:116
msgid "I've come back. Make me an offer, then."
msgstr "我又回来了。那你出个价吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:125
msgid ""
"Bram's kin at the stall at last! One coin for it, for luck. Not a penny more, I won't hear of it."
msgstr "布拉姆的亲人终于来看摊了！收一枚金币，图个吉利。多一个子儿都不要，别跟我争。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:126
msgid ""
"Bram was good to us for forty years. One coin and it's yours. Welcome to the crossroads."
msgstr "布拉姆照应了我们四十年。一枚金币，它就是你的了。欢迎来到十字路口。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:127
msgid ""
"A welcome present for the new Keywright. One coin, mind: it's bad luck to give a chest for nothing."
msgstr "给新钥匠的见面礼。不过得收一枚金币，记着：白送宝箱可不吉利。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:163
msgid "Ah, you've had your hands on it. Then it's {0}."
msgstr "啊，你上手碰过了。那就得{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:245
msgid "Wardens? I'm off!"
msgstr "巡守？我溜了！"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:245
msgid "You'd shop me? Keep it, then!"
msgstr "你要告发我？那箱子归你了！"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:245
msgid "Not today, Wardens. Not today."
msgstr "今天可不行，巡守。今天可不行。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:300
msgid ""
"King Aldric's own chest, sealed since the Locking. The Gate's gone quiet. Every bit of it is yours."
msgstr "奥德里克国王自己的宝箱，自大封锁以来一直封存。大门已归于沉寂。里面的一切都归你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:306
msgid ""
"Nothing rattled because there was nothing there, but {0}. Only a Keywright hears a Heartsong sing."
msgstr "什么都没响，因为里面除了{0}，什么都没有。只有钥匠听得见心歌歌唱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:307
msgid "Empty! Nothing rattled because there was nothing there."
msgstr "空的！什么都没响，因为里面什么都没有。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:313
msgid ""
"{0}: gilded iron from the Maw's hoard. A lodestone would have silenced it."
msgid_plural ""
"{0}: gilded iron from the Maw's hoard. A lodestone would have silenced them."
msgstr[0] "{0}：来自巨口宝藏的镀金铁。用了磁石，就不会有这声响了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:316
msgid "All genuine this time, and {0} sold it cheap."
msgstr "这次全是真货，{0}还卖便宜了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:318
msgid ""
"The {0} sand: it pours at a gentle shake, where parchment never rustles."
msgstr "那{0}其实是沙子：轻摇就会流动，而羊皮纸轻摇时从不沙沙作响。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:318
msgid "rustle was"
msgstr "沙沙声"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:318
msgid "rustles were"
msgstr "几声沙沙声"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:322
msgid ""
"{0} charged the same for every rattle she heard: {1} of them, whatever they were."
msgstr "{0}听到一声响就收一份同样的钱：一共{1}声，不管里面是什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:328
msgid "{0} went by weight: the {1} made it heavy."
msgstr "{0}看重量定价：{1}让它变得沉甸甸的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:329
msgid "The {0} weighed next to nothing to {1}."
msgstr "在{1}看来，{0}几乎没有分量。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:333
msgid "One coin for a {0} chest. The price comes later, from everyone after."
msgstr "一只{0}宝箱，只收一枚金币。代价在后头：之后来的每个人都会跟你多要钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:336
msgid "{0} priced it as an ordinary {1} chest, without looking inside."
msgstr "{0}没看里面，只按一只普通的{1}宝箱来定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:339
msgid ""
"{0}'s price came from a dream. Only the chest could tell you what it was worth."
msgstr "{0}的价格来自一场梦。它到底值多少，只有宝箱自己知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:342
msgid ""
"{0} priced her gems at what she paid for them; everything else came free."
msgstr "{0}按她买宝石时付的钱给宝石定价；其余的东西都是白送的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:347
msgid "{0} priced the {1} like a diamond fit for a crown."
msgstr "{0}把{1}当成配得上王冠的钻石来定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:349
msgid "He priced the {0} at half."
msgstr "他把{0}按半价算了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:353
msgid "{0} let your slip set the price."
msgstr "{0}让你的估价单来定价。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:356
msgid "{0} had no idea what was inside."
msgstr "{0}完全不知道里面有什么。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:367
msgid "The clank drowned out the {0} for {1}"
msgstr "对{1}来说，哐啷声盖过了{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:368
msgid "Nothing stirs the {0} through straw"
msgstr "隔着稻草，怎么摇也摇不出{0}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:369
msgid "Through the straw, {0}'s shake was too gentle to stir the {1}"
msgstr "隔着稻草，{0}摇得太轻，没能摇出{1}声"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:370
msgid "{0} didn't shake hard enough to stir the {1}"
msgstr "{0}摇得不够用力，没能摇出{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:371
msgid "{0} shook {1} and missed the {2}"
msgstr "{0}{1}摇过，却漏掉了{2}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:372
msgid "{0}: {1}, unpriced."
msgstr "{0}：{1}未被计价。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:376
msgid "{0} heard the {1} but never counted: {2} for the price of one."
msgstr "{0}听到了{1}声，却没去数：{2}件只算了一件的钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:379
msgid "The ticket counted the false bottom, but {0} never reads tickets: {1}."
msgstr "当票把夹层里的也算进去了，可{0}从来不看当票：{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:380
msgid "The Guild's tally counted the false bottom too: {0}."
msgstr "公会的清点把夹层里的也算进去了：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:381
msgid "A false bottom nobody knew about: {0}."
msgstr "谁也不知道的夹层：{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:384
msgid ""
"You named what the ward held, and it gave it up: the {0}. Nobody had priced it."
msgstr "你说出了结界封住的东西，它便交了出来：{0}。谁都没给它定过价。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:386
msgid "Warded, silent and weightless: the {0}. {1}"
msgstr "被结界封住，无声又无重：{0}。{1}"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:388
msgid "Only a Keywright hears a Heartsong sing: nobody knew {0} was in it."
msgstr "只有钥匠听得见心歌歌唱：谁也不知道里面有{0}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:391
msgid ""
"Nobody can hear enchantment: the {0} went for the price of plain goods."
msgstr "附魔是听不出来的：{0}只卖了普通货的价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:394
msgid "{0} heard everything, and always asks a bit more than it's worth."
msgstr "{0}什么都听出来了，而且总是比实际价值多要一点。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:395
msgid "{0} heard everything. The deal was in the price you agreed."
msgstr "{0}什么都听出来了。划不划算，全看你们谈定的价钱。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:402
msgid "{0} in the dream, and nothing of the kind to hear: that was it."
msgstr "梦里有{0}，却听不到那类东西的声响：就是它了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:403
msgid "{0} on the tag that never made a sound: that was it."
msgstr "标签上写着{0}，却从没发出过声音：就是它了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:404
msgid "The riddle was about it, and it never made a sound."
msgstr "谜语说的就是它，而它从没发出过声音。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:408
msgid "The dowry's coin never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妆里的钱币从没发出过声音：新娘用结界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:409
msgid "The dowry's cloak never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妆里的斗篷从没发出过声音：新娘用结界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:410
msgid "The dowry's potion never made a sound: the bride had warded it."
msgstr "嫁妆里的药水从没发出过声音：新娘用结界把它封住了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:412
msgid "The roll's '{0}' was the {1}."
msgstr "结界名录上的“{0}”就是{1}。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:413
msgid "A {0} echo that never made a sound: that was it."
msgstr "回声里那个{0}东西从没出过声：就是它。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:414
msgid "{0} came up twice."
msgstr "{0}出现了两次。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:415
msgid "Nobody could have known."
msgstr "谁也不可能知道。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:432
msgid "You have a feeling you dodged a cart."
msgstr "你觉得自己刚刚躲过了一劫。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:432
msgid "Somewhere, your purse sighs with relief."
msgstr "冥冥之中，你的钱袋松了一口气。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:432 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:448
msgid "You have a feeling you made the right call."
msgstr "你觉得自己做了正确的决定。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:433 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:447
msgid "Nothing to lose sleep over."
msgstr "不值得为此失眠。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:433
msgid "Your gut shrugs. Fair enough."
msgstr "你的直觉耸了耸肩。也罢。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:433
msgid "It felt overpriced. It probably was."
msgstr "感觉要价太高。多半确实如此。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:434
msgid "Could have gone either way."
msgstr "怎么选都说得过去。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:434
msgid "Your gut says nothing. It's sulking a little."
msgstr "你的直觉一言不发。它有点闹别扭。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:434
msgid "Meh. A wash, probably."
msgstr "嗯……大概不赚不赔吧。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:435 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:446
msgid "Maybe that wasn't the best idea."
msgstr "也许这不是什么好主意。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:435
msgid "A small voice whispers: you should've bought that."
msgstr "一个细小的声音低语：你本该买下它的。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:435
msgid "Your gut grumbles."
msgstr "你的直觉在嘟囔。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:436
msgid "You have a nasty feeling a bargain just walked out the door."
msgstr "你有种不妙的感觉：一笔便宜买卖刚刚走出了门。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:436
msgid "Your gut is writing you a strongly worded letter."
msgstr "你的直觉正在给你写一封措辞严厉的信。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:437
msgid "Somewhere, a better shopkeeper is laughing."
msgstr "某处，一个更高明的店主正在偷笑。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:438 scripts/Core/Visit.cs:444
msgid "Even the heavens pity you."
msgstr "连老天都可怜你。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:438
msgid "Uncle Bram, somewhere, is weeping softly."
msgstr "布拉姆叔叔不知在哪儿轻声啜泣。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:438
msgid "Your gut has stopped speaking to you."
msgstr "你的直觉已经不想理你了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:444
msgid "You feel like you just paid for the privilege of being robbed."
msgstr "你感觉自己刚刚花钱买了个被抢的资格。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:445
msgid "You feel like you just got fleeced."
msgstr "你感觉自己刚被狠宰了一刀。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:445
msgid "Your purse feels lighter. Your heart, heavier."
msgstr "钱袋轻了。心却沉了。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:446
msgid "Close, but the house won. You are the house."
msgstr "差一点，可惜庄家赢了。而庄家就是你。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:447
msgid "A fair day's trade."
msgstr "一笔公道的买卖。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:448
msgid "Your gut does a little dance."
msgstr "你的直觉高兴得跳起了舞。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:449
msgid "Highway robbery. The legal kind."
msgstr "简直是拦路抢劫。合法的那种。"

#: scripts/Core/Visit.cs:449
msgid "The heavens smile on you. Don't let it go to your head."
msgstr "老天在对你微笑。可别得意忘形。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:493
msgid "Achievement: {0}"
msgstr "达成成就：{0}"

#: scripts/Main.cs:598
msgid "In the purse: {0}g."
msgstr "钱袋里有{0}金。"

#: scripts/Main.cs:606
msgid ""
"The notebook and the collection are full: every regular, every thing, every curio, and all nine Heartsongs."
